{"parentUuid":"f1d16cfc-da01-4966-8ebd-bbf9fd8b33bb","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgBYmrMqY5prkYdBWmrpM","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Captain, I checked the forefront-backend repo-green worker (task-ttugb) directly. It is still mid-validation, and its fix is committed on the worker's branch. No PR is ready yet.\n\nThe two most recent CI runs on that branch failed in 3–4 seconds. That matches the known problem on voicefirst-landing PR 86 (task-wh6t9), where the GitHub Actions job fails in seconds before running any steps. If so, the PR may never show green on its own, and you may need to waive the check or fix the Actions problem. I'll confirm once the worker reports.\n\nI couldn't set a separate fallback timer, because the fleet blocks that tool for this session. The fleet's own monitoring is the fallback and will wake me when the worker reports.\n\nTwo PRs need your merge word:\n1. **Brain PR 44:** https://github.com/trillium/brain/pull/44 is green. Land it first.\n2. **Brain PR 45:** https://github.com/trillium/brain/pull/45 is green (fixes robots-gbu6f). It goes second.\n\nOther decisions waiting on you:\n1. **Codex/agy batch:** \"go\" to dispatch it.\n2. **forefront-backend PR 6:** https://github.com/trillium/forefront-backend/pull/6 has a failing `typecheck-and-test` check. Say so if you want it waived.\n3. **robots-sl1eq:** should `brain` refuse writes when no `BEADS_DIR` is set and no local `.beads` exists? I recommend refusing.\n4. **Hold fix:** which branch to land. I recommend `fm/robots-bii4o-hold-q1`."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":642,"cache_read_input_tokens":124225,"output_tokens":577,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":30},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_