{"parentUuid":"343faab9-4035-402a-bb4c-f6833d32c2b8","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgBZNeC56JPKNRbSrAbB5","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Captain, the forefront-backend repo-green work (task-ttugb) is up as PR 7, and its only red check is a GitHub Actions problem, not the code: https://github.com/trillium/forefront-backend/pull/7\n\nIt adds `@types/bun`, a typecheck script, a CI workflow and 16 route tests. In a clean export of the branch, the typecheck passes and all 78 tests pass. The `typecheck-and-test` check fails in 2 seconds with no steps run, because Actions never starts a runner. The same thing hits voicefirst-landing PR 86 (task-wh6t9), and the worker filed a follow-up (task-calfm). The worker is parked waiting on that red check.\n\nDecisions waiting on you:\n1. **Forefront-backend PR 7:** waive the Actions failure and let me merge it, or hold until the Actions problem is fixed. I recommend waiving, since the local checks are green.\n2. **Brain PR 44:** https://github.com/trillium/brain/pull/44 is green. Land it first.\n3. **Brain PR 45:** https://github.com/trillium/brain/pull/45 is green (fixes robots-gbu6f). It goes second.\n4. **Codex/agy batch:** \"go\" to dispatch it.\n5. **forefront-backend PR 6:** https://github.com/trillium/forefront-backend/pull/6 has the same Actions failure. Say so if you want it waived too.\n6. **robots-sl1eq:** should `brain` refuse writes when no `BEADS_DIR` is set and no local `.beads` exists? I recommend refusing.\n7. **Hold fix:** which branch to land. I recommend `fm/robots-bii4o-hold-q1`."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":550,"cache_read_input_tokens":129155,"output_tokens":577,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ep