{"parentUuid":"90bc6bb6-6562-4f2a-abd7-8ec3a38729f8","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgBdM1SfyVs3QgMMW1Ptm","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Captain, one GitHub billing fix will clear red checks on at least four repos. Today I confirmed the cause on the barter report (robots-936cm), forefront-backend PR 6 and PR 7, and voicefirst-landing PR 86. Failed payments or the Actions spending limit are stopping jobs from starting.\n\nI added the evidence to robots-936cm. I also added my own repro to robots-d8dvl, where a guard blocks the fallback timer that another guard demands.\n\nUsage hasn't moved: Claude has 45% left and Fable 40% (resets at midnight UTC tonight), and Codex is idle. Nothing has landed and no workers are running.\n\nDecisions waiting on you:\n1. **GitHub billing:** check github.com/settings/billing. Fixing it lets the failed checks re-run green.\n2. **Brain PR 44:** https://github.com/trillium/brain/pull/44 is green. Land it first.\n3. **Brain PR 45:** https://github.com/trillium/brain/pull/45 is green (fixes robots-gbu6f). It goes second.\n4. **Firstmate-repo fixes:** consent to contribute fixes for robots-wajev, robots-q22c and robots-d8dvl.\n5. **Codex/agy batch:** \"go\" to dispatch it.\n6. **robots-sl1eq:** should `brain` refuse writes when no `BEADS_DIR` is set and no local `.beads` exists? I recommend refusing.\n7. **Hold fix:** which branch to land. I recommend `fm/robots-bii4o-hold-q1`."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":778,"cache_read_input_tokens":141719,"output_tokens":533,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":778,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":