inbox-nwdj stays open until scope verified.        \n      Related: project-73bi.3 (displayd OSS improvement pass).                    \n  2026-10-17 09:13 Trillium Smith\n    \n      CORRECTION (supersedes the earlier HOME comment): Sidecar is NOT part of    \n      displayd. It has no repo of its own yet; code is currently split across     \n      displayd (server: multi-Sidecar surfaces API, event streams, columns,       \n      inbox-90re closed with answer: Next.js site is personal portfolio on Vercel \n      via *.trilliumsmith.com wildcard; sidecar. name is free. Plan: explicit A   \n      record sidecar. -> vps01 overrides wildcard only; Caddy vhost proxies to    \n      tailnet macbook:8792; QR pairing stays as auth. Task filed for the DNS +    \n      Caddy write step. No live changes made from this chat yet.                  \n  2026-10-19 06:13 Trillium Smith\n    \n      2026-10-19: PUBLIC LIVE at https://sidecar.trilliumsmith.com (A record ->   \n      vps01 198.12.123.41 + Caddy vhost, by macbook-ops). Firstmate verified via  \n      1.1.1.1 / --resolve: healthz 200, /v1/devices 401, /pair 404. Some local    \n      resolvers still cache the old wildcard (Vercel) for a while.","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"13890299-6f60-493c-a2d6-7e28c778da73","timestamp":"2026-10-19T13:12:12.505Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"  claude,all_models,45,6.4336,through_reset,established,seven_day,\"2026-10-20T00:00:00.116459+00:00\"\n  claude,\"model:fable\",40,6.0134,through_reset,established,\"model:fable\",\"2026-10-20T00:00:00.116633+00:00\"\n○ project-yg4v · Sidecar   [● P0 · OPEN]\nOwner: Trillium Smith · Type: task\nCreated: 2026-10-17 · Updated: 2026-10-17\n\nDESCRIPTION\n\n  P0 project: A managed display sidecar for Beads Bridge live usage and a     \n  display monitor that turns MCP/tool usage into useful at-a-glance input. The\n  precise monitor design is still open. Core invariant: when a device loads   \n  the page, it reports its available/viewable viewport area 