{"parentUuid":"fb1686ee-cf43-49ea-8fc3-0c187c4acf8c","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgBes7wYVHQFZUf5eJeLP","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Captain, Sidecar is healthy. I checked `sidecar.trilliumsmith.com` against the new server address and it answers 200. macbook-ops reports two things in flight:\n- **Talon palette feed:** now tailnet-only (127.0.0.1:7399 behind tailscale serve; LAN refused, no Funnel). One evidence gap remains.\n- **Share follow-on:** done, with a note field and intent chips added to the receiver and the app. It is on branch `fm/firstmate-share-build-20261019`, and the Share branch still needs landing.\n\n**Usage:** Claude has 45% left and Fable 40% (resets at midnight UTC tonight). Nothing has landed since the last poke.\n\nDecisions waiting on you:\n1. **Inbox bead inbox-cglf:** Apple Notes is enabled with 51 tools live. Which tool group should I turn off, `firstmate_mcp` (117 tools) or the other one?\n2. **GitHub billing:** check github.com/settings/billing. A failed payment or spending limit is stopping Actions jobs from starting, which is why forefront-backend PR 6 and PR 7 (https://github.com/trillium/forefront-backend/pull/7) show red.\n3. **Brain PR 44:** https://github.com/trillium/brain/pull/44 is green. Land it first.\n4. **Brain PR 45:** https://github.com/trillium/brain/pull/45 is green (fixes robots-gbu6f). It goes second.\n5. **Firstmate-repo fixes:** consent to contribute fixes for robots-wajev, robots-q22c and robots-d8dvl.\n6. **agy batch:** \"go\" to dispatch it.\n7. **robots-sl1eq:** should `brain` refuse writes when no `BEADS_DIR` is set and no local `.beads` exists? I recommend refusing.\n8. **Hold fix:** which branch to land. I recommend `fm/robots-bii4o-hold-q1`."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":858,"cache_read_input_tokens":147417,"output