{"parentUuid":"b9fe0661-943c-4e79-a0ec-dc42ac4b750e","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgBgEV8Tf7rDpL62zavjf","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Captain, I started a worker on robots-pejry (24 failing hook tests in worktrees). In worktrees, the link to the shared hook tools points nowhere, so those tests can't find them. The fix is to make the tests find the tools from worktrees too. It's a small change that opens a pull request and merges once checks are green, per your standing setting for this project. Because of the billing problem, I'll check that PR's checks before merging.\n\nUsage: Claude has 45% left and Fable 40%.\n\nDecisions waiting on you:\n1. **GitHub billing:** check github.com/settings/billing. A failed payment or spending limit is stopping Actions jobs from starting, which is why forefront-backend PR 6 and PR 7 (https://github.com/trillium/forefront-backend/pull/7) show red.\n2. **Brain PR 44:** https://github.com/trillium/brain/pull/44 is green. Land it first.\n3. **Brain PR 45:** https://github.com/trillium/brain/pull/45 is green (fixes robots-gbu6f). It goes second.\n4. **Firstmate-repo fixes:** consent to contribute fixes for robots-wajev, robots-q22c and robots-d8dvl.\n5. **agy batch:** \"go\" to dispatch it.\n6. **robots-sl1eq:** should `brain` refuse writes when no `BEADS_DIR` is set and no local `.beads` exists? I recommend refusing.\n7. **Hold fix:** which branch to land. I recommend `fm/robots-bii4o-hold-q1`."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":292,"cache_read_input_tokens":151891,"output_tokens":520,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":292,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_t