{"parentUuid":"bdbcb748-7d9c-481d-8789-ed5ff3308d37","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgBgNvn3TRu41F5NxHB6u","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Captain, the worker on robots-pejry (the 24 failing hook tests in worktrees) is running. It has reproduced the failure and is writing the fix. Nothing has landed since the last poke, and I'm holding any merge until the PR's checks show green.\n\n**Usage:** Claude has 45% left and Fable 40%, with the window resetting at midnight UTC tonight.\n\nDecisions waiting on you:\n1. **GitHub billing:** check github.com/settings/billing. A failed payment or spending limit is stopping Actions jobs from starting, which is why forefront-backend PR 6 and PR 7 (https://github.com/trillium/forefront-backend/pull/7) show red.\n2. **Brain PR 44:** https://github.com/trillium/brain/pull/44 is green. Land it first.\n3. **Brain PR 45:** https://github.com/trillium/brain/pull/45 is green (fixes robots-gbu6f). It goes second.\n4. **Firstmate-repo fixes:** consent to contribute fixes for robots-wajev, robots-q22c and robots-d8dvl.\n5. **agy batch:** \"go\" to dispatch it.\n6. **robots-sl1eq:** should `brain` refuse writes when no `BEADS_DIR` is set and no local `.beads` exists? I recommend refusing.\n7. **Hold fix:** which branch to land. I recommend `fm/robots-bii4o-hold-q1`."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":354,"cache_read_input_tokens":153419,"output_tokens":486,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":354,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":486,"cache_read_input_tokens":153419,"cache_creation_input_tokens":354,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,