{"parentUuid":"db4381b7-31c6-4f8a-bd61-5e21145f53e3","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgBhDtpq8tZJNTZhBDGPg","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Captain, the robots-pejry worker had died, so I replaced it. Its terminal was gone and neither steering nor relaunch could reach it. I checked first and it left no unsaved work, so I cleaned it up and started a fresh worker on the same task. That worker has the decision: skip the tests that need the deprecated tools folder, and file a follow-up for the real dependency removal. It opens a PR and merges once checks are green, which the billing problem may delay.\n\nDecisions waiting on you:\n1. **GitHub billing:** check github.com/settings/billing. A failed payment or spending limit is stopping Actions jobs from starting, which is why forefront-backend PR 6 and PR 7 (https://github.com/trillium/forefront-backend/pull/7) show red.\n2. **Brain PR 44:** https://github.com/trillium/brain/pull/44 is green. Land it first.\n3. **Brain PR 45:** https://github.com/trillium/brain/pull/45 is green (fixes robots-gbu6f). It goes second.\n4. **Firstmate-repo fixes:** consent to contribute fixes for robots-wajev, robots-q22c and robots-d8dvl.\n5. **agy batch:** \"go\" to dispatch it.\n6. **robots-sl1eq:** should `brain` refuse writes when no `BEADS_DIR` is set and no local `.beads` exists? I recommend refusing.\n7. **Hold fix:** which branch to land. I recommend `fm/robots-bii4o-hold-q1`."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":185,"cache_read_input_tokens":162919,"output_tokens":511,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":185,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_token