{"parentUuid":"3fb409c7-8585-435b-805a-87b0dfcf314e","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgBjdEcKjYVf8YVqFGRuE","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Captain, I merged behavioral-hooks PR 31 (https://github.com/trillium/behavioral-hooks/pull/31). That closes robots-14w31. Its worker is cleaned up.\n\n**In flight:** a worker is fixing a false alarm in the fm-hooks fleet-ledger rule (task-37b80163). A guard refused a `git add -A`, and the rule blamed the ledger step, which was guarded with `|| true` and never failed. The worker adds a regression test, and I merge when it's green.\n\n**Sidecar:** the public site is live at https://sidecar.trilliumsmith.com. The remaining palette follow-ups are with macbook-ops: task-eykz1, task-rge87, task-oahqr and task-myaks.\n\n**Usage:** Claude has 45% left and Fable 40%, with the window resetting 2026-10-20 at 00:00 UTC. That's still underspent.\n\nAll of this is logged in status-kdv.\n\nStill waiting on you:\n1. Fix GitHub billing at github.com/settings/billing.\n2. Merge brain PR 44 (https://github.com/trillium/brain/pull/44), then PR 45 (https://github.com/trillium/brain/pull/45).\n3. Decide forefront-backend PR 7 (https://github.com/trillium/forefront-backend/pull/7). Either waive the red check or fix billing and re-run it. I recommend fixing billing.\n4. Give consent to publish fixes in the firstmate repo."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":291,"cache_read_input_tokens":110807,"output_tokens":498,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":291,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":498,"cache_read_input_tokens":110807,"cache_creation_input_tokens":291,