{"parentUuid":"6efa844b-b7b8-40df-8aee-98dbf002187a","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"e3c0c072-4f33-4484-a382-9e331c4a0b47","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01DsrV2j7p5KhX5PPwV3Mfyp","type":"tool_result","content":"○ task-ho60f · Barterboo: onboarding socials server action stores linked-account URLs unvalidated (javascript: hrefs possible)   [● P1 · OPEN]\nOwner: Trillium Smith · Type: task\nCreated: 2026-10-18 · Updated: 2026-10-18\n\nDESCRIPTION\n\n  Found during task-xbo7p gnhf run review. origin/main 70bf1783:              \n  src/app/actions/onboarding-steps.ts ~L211-226 (socials step handler of      \n  saveOnboardingStep) inserts data.socials[].url into linked_external_accounts\n  verbatim, with no safeUrlSchema check, unlike src/app/actions/linked-       \n  accounts.ts:40,99. src/components/profile/linked-accounts-section.tsx:41    \n  renders href={account.url} on the public profile. A direct server-action    \n  call can store javascript:/mailto: URLs. React 19 (^19.2.5) blocks          \n  javascript: hrefs at render, which mitigates the click-through XSS, but the \n  server-side validation gap remains. gnhf commit 42e7e28c on local branch    \n  gnhf/onboarding-usability-n1 adds only client-side validation (isSafeUrl); a\n  server-side fix is still needed. Not fixed by this task.                    \n\n\n\nLABELS: fleet:firstmate, project:barter\n\nMETADATA\n  brain_slug: barter-book-onboarding-socials-server-action-stores-linked-account-urls-unvalidated-javascript-hrefs-possible\n\n- barter [no-mistakes-prod-only] - Barterboo (barterboo.com) trading app, Next.js; origin trillium/barter; clone at ~/code/barter (symlinked); merges stay captain-approved, yolo off (added 2026-10-18)","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"7a4ef1ee-067b-4544-9ee4-c628a4554485","timestamp":"2026-10-19T14:52:13.555Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"○ task-ho60f · Barterboo: onboarding socials server action stores linked-account URLs unvalidated (javascript: hrefs possible)   [● P1 · OPEN]\nOwner: Trillium Smith · Type: task\nCreated: 2026-10-18 · Updated: 2026-10-18\n\nDESCRIPTION\n\n  Found during task-xbo7p gnhf run review. origin/main 70bf1783:              \n  src/app/actions/onboarding-steps.ts ~L211-226 (socials step handler of      \n  saveOnboardingStep) inserts data.socials[].url into linked_external_accounts\n  verbatim, with no safeUrlSchema check, unlike src/app/actions/linked-       \n  accounts.ts:40,99. src/components/profile/linked-accounts-section.tsx:41    \n  renders href={account.url} on the public profile. A direct server-action    \n  call can store javascript:/mailto: URLs. React 19 (^19.2.5) blocks          \n  javascript: hrefs at render, which mitigates the click-through XSS, but the \n  server-side validation gap remains. gnhf commit 42e7e28c on local branch    \n  gnhf/onboarding-usability-n1 adds only client-side validation (isSafeUrl); a\n  server-side fix is still needed. Not fixed by this task.                    \n\n\n\nLABELS: fleet:firstmate, project:barter\n\nMETADATA\n  brain_slug: barter-book-onboarding-socials-server-action-stores-linked-account-urls-unvalidated-javascript-hrefs-possible\n\n- barter [no-mistakes-prod-only] - Barterboo (barterboo.com) trading app, Next.js; origin trillium/barter; clone at ~/code/barter (symlinked); merges stay captain-approved, yolo off (added 2026-10-18)","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"6efa844b-b7b8-40df-8aee-98dbf002187a","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"session_id":"3b59b3ab-40e2-4906-ae5b-518d2b1a7b53","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/trilliumsmith/fm_home/firstmate","sessionId":"3b59b3ab-40e2-4906-ae5b-518d2b1a7b53","version":"2.1.293","gitBranch":"main","slug":"floating-tinkering-lemur"}
