{"parentUuid":"5505cf35-3598-4c9e-9151-0c8642fd0c9f","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgBnWhMKnGuBxHBPuifP6","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Captain, I found nothing new to dispatch this poke. The Barterboo URL-validation fix (task-ho60f) already exists, so I didn't start a duplicate.\n\n**Barterboo PR 2:** it's open at https://github.com/trillium/barter/pull/2 and validates the social-link URLs on the server. Build, Vercel, CodeRabbit and GitGuardian pass. Unit Tests, Lint/Type-check and the WCAG check are red. A worker's earlier local run found 29 failing unit tests in unrelated files, and Actions can't run because of billing. A parked worker holds the same fix as commit 318d0479, so I'm not opening a third copy. Barterboo merges need your word, so tell me whether to merge PR 2 despite the red checks.\n\n**In flight:** the brain worker on robots-qi64x (remote-forward file paths) is still working.\n\n**Usage:** Claude has about 45% left, with the window resetting 2026-10-20 at 00:00 UTC.\n\nEverything is recorded on the task bead and in status-kdv.\n\nStill waiting on you:\n1. Fix GitHub billing at github.com/settings/billing.\n2. Merge brain PR 44 (https://github.com/trillium/brain/pull/44), then PR 45 (https://github.com/trillium/brain/pull/45).\n3. Decide forefront-backend PR 7 (https://github.com/trillium/forefront-backend/pull/7). Either waive the red check or fix billing and re-run it. I recommend fixing billing.\n4. Say \"land fm/robots-fy7f9-fix\" to merge the iphone-contacts-sync test fix.\n5. Give consent to publish fixes in the firstmate repo."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":594,"cache_read_input_tokens":127721,"output_tokens":574,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","ca