{"parentUuid":"7ff00808-df44-4062-8ff1-88739aea3903","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgBoNgzPSCvnP6Mpx8yNu","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Captain, the brain worker's validation paused on two review findings about the remote-forward file-path fix (robots-qi64x). I decided both and sent the answer to the worker.\n\n1. **`create`, `batch` and `comments add` with `--file`:** fixed in its smallest form. Those commands can't read a file from stdin on the remote host, so forwarding now stops with one clear error instead of failing confusingly there. Full support stays in task-tywam.\n2. **`-f` short alias:** skipped. It needs per-command knowledge the forwarder doesn't have, so it also goes to task-tywam.\n\nThe worker continues through validation and I'll bring you the PR link. It's logged in status-kdv.\n\nStill waiting on you:\n1. Fix GitHub billing at github.com/settings/billing.\n2. Merge brain PR 44 (https://github.com/trillium/brain/pull/44), then PR 45 (https://github.com/trillium/brain/pull/45).\n3. Decide forefront-backend PR 7 (https://github.com/trillium/forefront-backend/pull/7). Either waive the red check or fix billing and re-run it. I recommend fixing billing.\n4. Decide Barterboo PR 2 (https://github.com/trillium/barter/pull/2). Merge it despite the red checks, or hold until billing is fixed.\n5. Say \"land fm/robots-fy7f9-fix\" to merge the iphone-contacts-sync test fix.\n6. Give consent to publish fixes in the firstmate repo."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1188,"cache_read_input_tokens":133149,"output_tokens":505,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1188,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations"