{"parentUuid":"76536b7a-29ae-4710-a11e-fd9bde8863c8","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgBokWZwV7rfPXadj1ikC","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Captain, the brain worker (robots-qi64x) hit a second review round and I answered it.\n\n1. **`create`, `batch` and `comments add` with `--file`:** skipped. The reviewer noted the narrowing was already my authorized decision, so it stays. Full support is tracked in task-tywam.\n2. **Duplicate flag list in the forwarder:** fixed. The worker drops the second copy and keeps one.\n\nThe worker continues validation and I'll bring you the PR link when it's ready.\n\nStill waiting on you:\n1. Fix GitHub billing at github.com/settings/billing.\n2. Merge brain PR 44 (https://github.com/trillium/brain/pull/44), then PR 45 (https://github.com/trillium/brain/pull/45).\n3. Decide forefront-backend PR 7 (https://github.com/trillium/forefront-backend/pull/7). Either waive the red check or fix billing and re-run it. I recommend fixing billing.\n4. Decide Barterboo PR 2 (https://github.com/trillium/barter/pull/2). Merge it despite the red checks, or hold until billing is fixed.\n5. Say \"land fm/robots-fy7f9-fix\" to merge the iphone-contacts-sync test fix.\n6. Give consent to publish fixes in the firstmate repo."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":593,"cache_read_input_tokens":137260,"output_tokens":441,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":593,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":441,"cache_read_input_tokens":137260,"cache_creation_input_tokens":593,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":593},"type":"message"}],"spee