{"parentUuid":"41148423-9311-499f-be7b-afc0c0404418","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgBosDr3cBcgati79utWZ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Captain, the brain worker for robots-qi64x hit a third review round, and I answered it.\n\n- **Auto-fix:** proceeds. An explicit `-` value was bypassing the one-stdin-per-command check.\n- **Skipped three:**\n  - piped input being dropped when a file flag is also given\n  - detecting the subcommand when options like `--json` come first\n  - the `create`/`batch`/`comments add` rejection, which I accepted as the settled narrowing\n\n  All three go to task-tywam. The first two would add new behavior beyond the accepted fix. The reviewer is also generating a fresh batch each round, so I'm closing the scope here.\n\nThe worker finishes validation and I'll bring you the PR link.\n\nStill waiting on you:\n1. Fix GitHub billing at github.com/settings/billing.\n2. Merge brain PR 44 (https://github.com/trillium/brain/pull/44), then PR 45 (https://github.com/trillium/brain/pull/45).\n3. Decide forefront-backend PR 7 (https://github.com/trillium/forefront-backend/pull/7). Either waive the red check or fix billing and re-run it. I recommend fixing billing.\n4. Decide Barterboo PR 2 (https://github.com/trillium/barter/pull/2). Merge it despite the red checks, or hold until billing is fixed.\n5. Say \"land fm/robots-fy7f9-fix\" to merge the iphone-contacts-sync test fix.\n6. Give consent to publish fixes in the firstmate repo."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":711,"cache_read_input_tokens":140610,"output_tokens":513,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":711,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","ite