{"parentUuid":"a1045767-c939-486d-a3a8-967cd5cce38f","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgBph3gxCujWvj9P6PXjg","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Captain, the fix for robots-qi64x is ready as brain PR 46: https://github.com/trillium/brain/pull/46. Its checks are green. Forwarded `--file`, `--body-file` and `--description-file` now send the local file to the remote host. It edits the same area as PRs 44 and 45, so it may need a rebase after they land. I've logged it on the bead and in status-kdv.\n\nMerging it is your call, since brain merges need your word.\n\nStill waiting on you:\n1. Merge brain PR 44 (https://github.com/trillium/brain/pull/44), then PR 45 (https://github.com/trillium/brain/pull/45), then PR 46 (https://github.com/trillium/brain/pull/46).\n2. Fix GitHub billing at github.com/settings/billing.\n3. Decide forefront-backend PR 7 (https://github.com/trillium/forefront-backend/pull/7). Either waive the red check or fix billing and re-run it. I recommend fixing billing.\n4. Decide Barterboo PR 2 (https://github.com/trillium/barter/pull/2). Merge it despite the red checks, or hold until billing is fixed.\n5. Say \"land fm/robots-fy7f9-fix\" to merge the iphone-contacts-sync test fix.\n6. Give consent to publish fixes in the firstmate repo."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":509,"cache_read_input_tokens":146186,"output_tokens":452,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":509,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":452,"cache_read_input_tokens":146186,"cache_creation_input_tokens":509,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":509},"type":"mess