{"parentUuid":"f623d872-a090-4787-8a76-8713b533b4a9","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"deferred_tools_record","entries":[],"toolInputCopies":[{"id":"toolu_01PtpmTqrsXTRMvHVFwFKUzy","copy":"wire"}]},"type":"attachment","uuid":"cd6a477b-69e0-4401-acdf-90407d91f138","timestamp":"2026-10-19T15:30:03.052Z","session_id":"3b59b3ab-40e2-4906-ae5b-518d2b1a7b53","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/trilliumsmith/fm_home/firstmate","sessionId":"3b59b3ab-40e2-4906-ae5b-518d2b1a7b53","version":"2.1.293","gitBranch":"main","slug":"floating-tinkering-lemur"}
{"parentUuid":"cd6a477b-69e0-4401-acdf-90407d91f138","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgBqMggVSXfmTmFRdaAwL","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Captain, I confirmed that the mini1 database forwarder is still open to every network interface. It listens on port 3307, the same port as the brain database server, instead of only on the tailnet.\n\nI filed a task to bind it to the tailnet address. The change goes through the dotfiles nix config, per the standing rule that device changes live there. I haven't changed anything on mini1 itself. I also logged it on idea-dko0 and in status-kdv.\n\nNothing is running now. I acked the inbox note.\n\nStill waiting on you:\n1. Merge brain PR 44 (https://github.com/trillium/brain/pull/44), then PR 45 (https://github.com/trillium/brain/pull/45), then PR 46 (https://github.com/trillium/brain/pull/46).\n2. Fix GitHub billing at github.com/settings/billing.\n3. Decide forefront-backend PR 7 (https://github.com/trillium/forefront-backend/pull/7). Either waive the red check or fix billing and re-run it. I recommend fixing billing.\n4. Decide Barterboo PR 2 (https://github.com/trillium/barter/pull/2). Merge it despite the red checks, or hold until billing is fixed.\n5. Say \"land fm/robots-fy7f9-fix\" to merge the iphone-contacts-sync test fix.\n6. Give consent to publish fixes in the firstmate repo.\n7. Reply in inbox-kv6b with your product-judgment claim, so it can carry into the PostHog resume mapping."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":546,"cache_read_input_tokens":150100,"output_tokens":505,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":546,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tok