{"parentUuid":"5d095338-5516-4959-b2b3-3c24e5e0f31c","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"e64aeaef-3e14-4ba2-9397-416c305355f5","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_013GFSeXwu6yugK3qb7LASQH","type":"tool_result","content":"  claude,all_models,44,7.9482,through_reset,established,seven_day,\"2026-10-20T00:00:00.061940+00:00\"\n  claude,\"model:fable\",40,7.6326,through_reset,established,\"model:fable\",\"2026-10-20T00:00:00.062096+00:00\"\n○ robots-ucj59 · bd bootstrap creates .beads/embeddeddolt in server-mode stores (root cause behind robots-jfqb; now only detected)   [● P2 · OPEN]\nOwner: Trillium Smith · Type: task\nCreated: 2026-10-18 · Updated: 2026-10-18\n\nDESCRIPTION\n\n  robots-jfqb was closed with a guard, not a fix: bead-doctor's embeddeddolt  \n  check (satellite-config, daily via com.pai.stores-doctor) FAILs when a      \n  server-mode ~/data//.beads holds embeddeddolt. 2026-10-18 scan found 4      \n  (macbook vrms, mini0 vrms, mini1 travel+vrms), all bootstrap-only, moved to \n  ~/data/_retired/embeddeddolt-20261018. Fix direction: bd bootstrap (and any \n  auto-init path) must refuse to create an embedded db when metadata.json     \n  dolt_mode=server.                                                           \n\n\n\nMETADATA\n  brain_slug: bd-bootstrap-creates-beads-embeddeddolt-in-server-mode-stores-root-cause-behind-robots-jfqb-now-only-detected","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"3c138e3f-6b20-465b-8189-e116722024e1","timestamp":"2026-10-19T15:32:10.108Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"  claude,all_models,44,7.9482,through_reset,established,seven_day,\"2026-10-20T00:00:00.061940+00:00\"\n  claude,\"model:fable\",40,7.6326,through_reset,established,\"model:fable\",\"2026-10-20T00:00:00.062096+00:00\"\n○ robots-ucj59 · bd bootstrap creates .beads/embeddeddolt in server-mode stores (root cause behind robots-jfqb; now only detected)   [● P2 · OPEN]\nOwner: Trillium Smith · Type: task\nCreated: 2026-10-18 · Updated: 2026-10-18\n\nDESCRIPTION\n\n  robots-jfqb was closed with a guard, not a fix: bead-doctor's embeddeddolt  \n  check (satellite-config, daily via com.pai.stores-doctor) FAILs when a      \n  server-mode ~/data//.beads holds embeddeddolt. 2026-10-18 scan found 4      \n  (macbook vrms, mini0 vrms, mini1 travel+vrms), all bootstrap-only, moved to \n  ~/data/_retired/embeddeddolt-20261018. Fix direction: bd bootstrap (and any \n  auto-init path) must refuse to create an embedded db when metadata.json     \n  dolt_mode=server.                                                           \n\n\n\nMETADATA\n  brain_slug: bd-bootstrap-creates-beads-embeddeddolt-in-server-mode-stores-root-cause-behind-robots-jfqb-now-only-detected","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"5d095338-5516-4959-b2b3-3c24e5e0f31c","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"session_id":"3b59b3ab-40e2-4906-ae5b-518d2b1a7b53","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/trilliumsmith/fm_home/firstmate","sessionId":"3b59b3ab-40e2-4906-ae5b-518d2b1a7b53","version":"2.1.293","gitBranch":"main","slug":"floating-tinkering-lemur"}
