{"parentUuid":"fa21ad6a-039d-41b4-8dcf-39234773ab1a","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgBqXUWHV57yWU4TpjdWu","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01QY1pfPmySdTXP6Vuo86djk","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"export FM_HOME=$PWD && bin/fm-brief.sh brain-bootstrap-q3 brain --mode no-mistakes 2>&1 | tail -1 && python3 -I - <<'E'\np='data/brain-bootstrap-q3/brief.md'\ns=open(p).read()\nt=\"\"\"Fix robots-ucj59: `bd bootstrap` (and any auto-init path) creates .beads/embeddeddolt inside a server-mode store. Today only bead-doctor's embeddeddolt check detects it after the fact (4 stores affected 2026-10-18: vrms on macbook/mini0/mini1, travel on mini1). Make bootstrap and auto-init refuse to create an embedded db when .beads/metadata.json has dolt_mode=server.\"\"\"\nf=\"\"\"Smallest change: a guard at the creation point(s) returning a clear error naming the server-mode store; add a test. Find every code path that creates embeddeddolt, not just bootstrap. Out of scope: bead-doctor, cleanup of existing stores.\"\"\"\nopen(p,'w').write(s.replace('{TASK}',t).replace('{FIRSTMATE_SPEC}',f))\nE\nbin/fm-tasks-axi.sh add brain-bootstrap-q3 'brain: bootstrap must not create embeddeddolt in server-mode store (robots-ucj59)' --kind ship 2>&1|tail -1\nHERDR_PANE_ID=wY7:p1 bin/fm-spawn.sh brain-bootstrap-q3 projects/brain --mode no-mistakes --yolo off --harness claude 2>&1 | tail -1\nrobots comment robots-ucj59 \"Dispatched ship brain-bootstrap-q3 (brain, no-mistakes).\" 2>&1|tail -1\nstatus comment status-kdv \"Poke: quota claude 44%/fable 40% (reset 10-20T00Z); no wakes. In flight: brain-bootstrap-q3 (robots-ucj59). Ready for captain: brain PR 44/45/46.\" 2>&1|tail -1"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":753,"cache_read_input_tokens":151430,"output_tokens":840,"output_tokens_d