{"parentUuid":"a17ea4dd-ef5f-44e2-94c8-d319934ef7bc","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgBqaqXQNnPFEJF65342C","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Captain, a worker is now on robots-ucj59, the bug where `bd bootstrap` creates a local database inside stores that run on the shared server. Four stores were affected on 2026-10-18 and were cleaned up by hand. The worker makes bootstrap and any auto-init path refuse in a server-mode store, and adds a test. It runs through the full validation pipeline and I'll bring you the PR.\n\nThere were no new notifications this poke. Claude has 44% left and Fable 40%, with the window resetting 2026-10-20 at 00:00 UTC. It's all logged in status-kdv.\n\nStill waiting on you:\n1. Merge brain PR 44 (https://github.com/trillium/brain/pull/44), then PR 45 (https://github.com/trillium/brain/pull/45), then PR 46 (https://github.com/trillium/brain/pull/46).\n2. Fix GitHub billing at github.com/settings/billing.\n3. Decide forefront-backend PR 7 (https://github.com/trillium/forefront-backend/pull/7). Either waive the red check or fix billing and re-run it. I recommend fixing billing.\n4. Decide Barterboo PR 2 (https://github.com/trillium/barter/pull/2). Merge it despite the red checks, or hold until billing is fixed.\n5. Say \"land fm/robots-fy7f9-fix\" to merge the iphone-contacts-sync test fix.\n6. Give consent to publish fixes in the firstmate repo.\n7. Reply in inbox-kv6b with your product-judgment claim."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1185,"cache_read_input_tokens":152183,"output_tokens":524,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1185,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_token