{"parentUuid":"575caf06-58a2-4da4-8f73-003b6ced8563","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgBqwzz1azkq4gUMD9dsT","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Captain, the notice was the forefront-backend repo-green worker, parked about four hours on PR 7 (https://github.com/trillium/forefront-backend/pull/7). It isn't stuck. Its only blocker is the red CI check, which fails because of the GitHub billing problem. I've acknowledged it and changed nothing.\n\nThe brain worker on robots-ucj59 is still running.\n\nStill waiting on you:\n1. Fix GitHub billing at github.com/settings/billing. That unblocks PR 7 and the other red checks.\n2. Waive PR 7's red check instead if you'd rather not wait. I recommend fixing billing.\n3. Merge brain PR 44 (https://github.com/trillium/brain/pull/44), then PR 45 (https://github.com/trillium/brain/pull/45), then PR 46 (https://github.com/trillium/brain/pull/46).\n4. Decide Barterboo PR 2 (https://github.com/trillium/barter/pull/2). Merge it despite the red checks, or hold until billing is fixed.\n5. Say \"land fm/robots-fy7f9-fix\" to merge the iphone-contacts-sync test fix.\n6. Give consent to publish fixes in the firstmate repo.\n7. Reply in inbox-kv6b with your product-judgment claim."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":223,"cache_read_input_tokens":154824,"output_tokens":439,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":223,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":439,"cache_read_input_tokens":154824,"cache_creation_input_tokens":223,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":223},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":nul