{"parentUuid":"659b83df-2001-413f-8ce1-4da9c3e4c4a0","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgBs4DdJTb4v8CjHKKSq5","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Captain, the worker on robots-ucj59 finished its fix. It adds a guard at all three places that create a local database (store creation, bootstrap clone, and the lock), and each now refuses when the store runs on the shared server. Tests pass. I've sent it to validation and will bring you the PR link.\n\nStill waiting on you:\n1. Merge brain PR 44 (https://github.com/trillium/brain/pull/44), then PR 45 (https://github.com/trillium/brain/pull/45), then PR 46 (https://github.com/trillium/brain/pull/46).\n2. Fix GitHub billing at github.com/settings/billing.\n3. Decide forefront-backend PR 7 (https://github.com/trillium/forefront-backend/pull/7). Either waive the red check or fix billing and re-run it. I recommend fixing billing.\n4. Decide Barterboo PR 2 (https://github.com/trillium/barter/pull/2). Merge it despite the red checks, or hold until billing is fixed.\n5. Say \"land fm/robots-fy7f9-fix\" to merge the iphone-contacts-sync test fix.\n6. Give consent to publish fixes in the firstmate repo.\n7. Reply in inbox-kv6b with your product-judgment claim."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":350,"cache_read_input_tokens":156188,"output_tokens":424,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":350,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":424,"cache_read_input_tokens":156188,"cache_creation_input_tokens":350,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":350},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_t