{"parentUuid":"c5416c19-8f72-43df-bd63-bdf5387a7511","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgBsK2aiRopsrmDjbYamx","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Captain, validation of the robots-ucj59 fix paused on two review findings, and I answered both.\n\n1. **Shared-server gap:** fixed. The guard checked only the store's own settings file. Bootstrap also treats a store as server-mode when the shared-server setting is on or a parent config says so, and in those cases it could still create a local database. The worker closes that and adds a test.\n2. **Corrupt settings file:** skipped. Making a corrupt file block bootstrap changes behavior for every store with a bad file, which goes beyond the accepted fix.\n\nThe worker continues and I'll bring you the PR link.\n\nStill waiting on you:\n1. Merge brain PR 44 (https://github.com/trillium/brain/pull/44), then PR 45 (https://github.com/trillium/brain/pull/45), then PR 46 (https://github.com/trillium/brain/pull/46).\n2. Fix GitHub billing at github.com/settings/billing.\n3. Decide forefront-backend PR 7 (https://github.com/trillium/forefront-backend/pull/7). Either waive the red check or fix billing and re-run it. I recommend fixing billing.\n4. Decide Barterboo PR 2 (https://github.com/trillium/barter/pull/2). Merge it despite the red checks, or hold until billing is fixed.\n5. Say \"land fm/robots-fy7f9-fix\" to merge the iphone-contacts-sync test fix.\n6. Give consent to publish fixes in the firstmate repo.\n7. Reply in inbox-kv6b with your product-judgment claim."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":674,"cache_read_input_tokens":158732,"output_tokens":527,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":674,"ephemeral_5m