{"parentUuid":"f6d39c14-1233-495a-93f7-ed0ec802da98","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgBspHB6mtDMCqwKJC7oL","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Captain, the robots-ucj59 worker's second review round raised one real finding, and I skipped it. For a brand-new store on the shared server, the guard now refuses and gives no in-tool way to create that store's database. Having bootstrap create it would be new behavior beyond the accepted fix, and the old behavior was the bug. The worker will make the error message accurate if that's a one-line change.\n\nA smaller test-naming issue is being fixed automatically. The worker continues and I'll bring you the PR link.\n\nStill waiting on you:\n1. Merge brain PR 44 (https://github.com/trillium/brain/pull/44), then PR 45 (https://github.com/trillium/brain/pull/45), then PR 46 (https://github.com/trillium/brain/pull/46).\n2. Fix GitHub billing at github.com/settings/billing.\n3. Decide forefront-backend PR 7 (https://github.com/trillium/forefront-backend/pull/7). Either waive the red check or fix billing and re-run it. I recommend fixing billing.\n4. Decide Barterboo PR 2 (https://github.com/trillium/barter/pull/2). Merge it despite the red checks, or hold until billing is fixed.\n5. Say \"land fm/robots-fy7f9-fix\" to merge the iphone-contacts-sync test fix.\n6. Give consent to publish fixes in the firstmate repo.\n7. Reply in inbox-kv6b with your product-judgment claim."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":645,"cache_read_input_tokens":163305,"output_tokens":490,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":645,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":490