{"parentUuid":"7fab5292-8206-4271-b70b-b03219210102","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgBtjLXVKHAMitRZo6r1f","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Captain, I dispatched one new fix this poke and logged the usage numbers in status-kdv.\n\n**Usage**\n- Claude has 44% of its weekly quota left (Fable 40%), and the window resets in about 8 hours.\n- That is underspent, so I started more work. Codex is at 100% and agy at about 96%, but codex isn't installed on this Mac.\n\n**Speed**\n- No PRs have landed since the last poke, because the merges are waiting on you.\n- I answered two ship gates.\n- About 12 ships are live.\n\n**Work started**\n- **Codex install (robots-xqffe):** a new worker is adding the codex CLI to the dotfiles nix config. It won't switch the live system or log in to codex, and it will leave a branch ready.\n- **Landing:** dotfiles is local-only with merge approval off, so I can't land it without your word.\n\n**BEADS_DIR bug (robots-gbu6f):** brain PR #45 already fixes it, and I recorded that in the bead. I'll close the bead when you merge https://github.com/trillium/brain/pull/45.\n\n**Waiting on you**\n- **Billing:** fix GitHub billing at github.com/settings/billing. CI is failing in about 2 seconds because of it.\n- **Brain PRs:** merge #44 (https://github.com/trillium/brain/pull/44), #45, then #46 (https://github.com/trillium/brain/pull/46).\n- **Forefront-backend PR 7:** waive the red check, or fix billing and re-run it (https://github.com/trillium/forefront-backend/pull/7). I recommend fixing billing.\n- **Barterboo PR 2:** merge despite the red checks, or hold (https://github.com/trillium/barter/pull/2).\n- **Dotfiles:** after the codex install lands, you'll need to log in to codex."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":504,"cache_read_input_tokens":107486,"output_tokens":614