nly client-side validation (isSafeUrl); a\n  server-side fix is still needed. Not fixed by this task.                    \n\n\n\nLABELS: fleet:firstmate, project:barter\n\nMETADATA\n  brain_slug: barter-book-onboarding-socials-server-action-stores-linked-account-urls-unvalidated-javascript-hrefs-possible","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"fb6ff9dc-f88c-46f5-a3ea-d0e0b13dcc36","timestamp":"2026-10-19T16:29:43.369Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"○ task-03lms · Barterboo SECURITY: trade_legs/proposals UPDATE RLS lets participants forge completed trades/reviews; move transitions into SECURITY DEFINER fns   [● P1 · OPEN]\nOwner: Trillium Smith · Type: task\nCreated: 2026-10-18 · Updated: 2026-10-18\n\nDESCRIPTION\n\n  From scout report data/barter-design-review-q1/report.md section 8 item 1   \n  (file:line evidence there). Fix: SECURITY DEFINER                           \n  accept/counter/complete/confirm/dispute functions, drop broad UPDATE        \n  policies, PGlite RLS tests. Ship, no-mistakes (product-facing). Merge is    \n  captain's.                                                                  \n\n\n\nMETADATA\n  brain_slug: barterboo-security-trade-legs-proposals-update-rls-lets-participants-forge-completed-trades-reviews-move-transitions-into-security-definer-fns\n\nCOMMENTS\n  2026-10-18 22:26 Trillium Smith\n    \n      Dispatched 2026-10-18 as ship barter-rls-q1 (no-mistakes, merge captain-    \n      approved).                                                                  \n\n  src/app/actions/onboarding-steps.ts ~L211-226 (socials step handler of      \n  saveOnboardingStep) inserts data.socials[].url into linked_external_accounts\n  verbatim, with no safeUrlSchema check, unlike src/app/actions/linked-       \n  accounts.ts:40,99. src/components/profile/linked-accounts-section.tsx:41    \n  renders href={account.url} on the public profile. A direct server-action    \n  call can store javascript:/mailto: URLs. React 19 (^19.2.5) blocks          \n  javascrip