{"parentUuid":"cc3169f9-7847-473a-bd1e-2aaa947c87b1","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgBuvnb5V2CEj7yveSz8K","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Captain, I triaged the ready task list and found nothing new to dispatch. Each top item already has a PR or worker waiting on your merge, or is blocked on GitHub billing.\n\n- **Forefront-backend security (task-4smbc):** already in PR #5 (https://github.com/trillium/forefront-backend/pull/5).\n- **Barterboo trade-forgery security (task-03lms):** already in PR #7 (https://github.com/trillium/barter/pull/7).\n- **Barterboo socials URL validation (task-ho60f):** already in PR #2 (https://github.com/trillium/barter/pull/2).\n- **Voicefirst-landing PR 86 (task-wh6t9):** its checks fail in 1–2 seconds with no runner, which is the billing problem.\n\nI acknowledged the inbox note and the wake, and logged the triage in status-kdv.\n\nThe merges are the bottleneck, so the fastest unblock is to fix billing at github.com/settings/billing and then merge the brain PRs #44 to #47 (e.g. https://github.com/trillium/brain/pull/47). Tell me if you want me to start something not yet on the list, such as a Sidecar or Talon palette task, and I'll dispatch it."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":504,"cache_read_input_tokens":118886,"output_tokens":412,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":504,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":412,"cache_read_input_tokens":118886,"cache_creation_input_tokens":504,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":504},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformation