{"parentUuid":"a89966c0-f46f-4ddc-a532-314cdd2a700d","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"a98aecb1-ef01-441f-80a1-87176e60cfb0","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01GGPJRSp4pF1YHd3yQPnHZv","type":"tool_result","content":"○ idea-v0fz ● P2 Talon palette: test running a Whisper-style speech model on the iPhone, feeding transcript to the mimic inject endpoint (captain asked 2026-10-19 whether palette is meant for this; cu\n○ idea-70ht ● P2 testflight-starter: promote a Share Extension target into template/ (with smoke assertion) once Firstmate Share (project-p16v) proves it; see data/firstmate-share-scout-20261019/repor\n○ idea-pag9 ● P2 forefront-backend: make lib/commitments runCommitments injectable so route tests can cover /commitments* with a valid credential\n○ idea-dko0 ● P2 mini1 fwd.py forwarder listens on *:3307 instead of loopback/tailnet only\n○ idea-gb6f ● P2 Laya shadows the main agent on stale wakes: main model's handling decisions are the labels, Laya predicts in shadow, log agreement, graduate to dropping wakes once accuracy is proven\n○ idea-m0kg ● P2 Remove Docker from this Mac; delegate all Docker activity to the linux machine (cross-system via remote docker context/ssh)\n○ idea-o01u ● P2 Sidecar as a full control surface via Talon: iPhone is the Talon route controller, Sidecar UI hosted on MacBook, iPhone interacts with Sidecar pane visuals from anywhere (links task-7\n○ idea-hcj3 ● P2 Process emails with Laya to determine if each is promotional and can be unsubscribed from\n○ idea-yyre ● P2 Entire (entire.io) CLI: captures coding-agent sessions and links them to commits as checkpoints. Install: curl -fsSL https://entire.io/install.sh | bash; entire login; entire enable (\n○ idea-zafy ● P2 Sidecar: an unrouted 404 still answers a browser with bare JSON (extend the refusal guide to it)\n○ question-d1fb987ae200 ● P1 CRITICAL SCOPE QUESTION: Does the QBO OAuth need to be implemented from scratch, or just configure redire