{"parentUuid":"12b087e4-5fce-49e8-8409-d48ebcfdf820","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgBvCRw3ZVJVywkWEB45F","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Captain, I dispatched one new fix this poke because usage is still underspent (Claude 44% left, Fable 40%, about 8 hours to reset).\n\n- **New worker:** it makes the commitments runner in forefront-backend injectable, for idea-pag9. Route tests can then cover `/commitments*` with a valid credential, without touching the live commitments store. It follows the full validation pipeline. You decide the merge.\n- **Other stores:** the remaining ready work is gated on you or can't be started yet.\n  - The review items, such as credential rotations and PR #23, need your decisions.\n  - The Sidecar and talon-palette-ios items are in projects not registered with me.\n- **Log:** I posted the numbers in status-kdv.\n\nStill waiting on you:\n- GitHub billing at github.com/settings/billing.\n- Brain PRs #44 to #47 (https://github.com/trillium/brain/pull/47).\n- Forefront-backend PR 7 (https://github.com/trillium/forefront-backend/pull/7).\n- Barterboo PR 2 (https://github.com/trillium/barter/pull/2).\n- Landing the codex install on branch `fm/dotfiles-codex-q1`."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":963,"cache_read_input_tokens":124789,"output_tokens":403,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":963,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":403,"cache_read_input_tokens":124789,"cache_creation_input_tokens":963,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":963},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_tra