{"parentUuid":"10789024-1290-44b8-a816-ee040931151a","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgBwrydU3PLnCXNgRuM8s","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Captain, four PRs are merged and a Fable scout is researching the phone-side Talon question.\n\n**Merged (yolo on for brain, forefront, forefront-backend and barter)**\n1. Brain PR #44 (the `--file` flag), #45 (the `BEADS_DIR` fix) and #47 (bootstrap refuses a local database in server-mode stores). https://github.com/trillium/brain/pull/47\n2. Forefront-backend PR #5 (the auth fix for `/config` and the other routes). https://github.com/trillium/forefront-backend/pull/5\n3. I closed the matching beads with the PR links as evidence: robots-gbu6f, robots-ucj59 and task-4smbc.\n\n**Not merged**\n- **Brain PR #46** (https://github.com/trillium/brain/pull/46) conflicts after #44 and #45 landed. I told its worker to rebase and re-validate. I'll merge it when it's green.\n- **Barterboo PRs #2 and #7** and **forefront-backend PR #7** still have red checks from the billing failure, and yolo doesn't cover red. To merge them either way, fix billing at github.com/settings/billing, or tell me to waive the red checks on one specific PR.\n\n**Talon on the phone**\n- **What exists:** `data/scout-talon-phone-asr/report.md` already covers part of this. Talon's recognizer is Mac-only and can't be ported. What can move to the phone is the transcription, using a Whisper-class model or Apple's on-device speech engine.\n- **The scout:** a Fable scout is writing `data/talon-phone-grammar-scout-q2/report.md`. It covers how to get a Talon-like command feel on the phone, an architecture where the phone recognizes speech and sends text or commands to the Mac, a staged plan with a small first spike, and the gaps in the existing docs. It writes no Talon voice commands or grammar.\n\nStill waiting on you: landing the codex install on branch `fm/dotfiles-codex-q1`, then logging in to codex."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":969,"cache_read_input_tokens":138272,"output_tokens":684,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":969,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":684,"cache_read_input_tokens":138272,"cache_creation_input_tokens":969,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":969},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgBwryMMCckXmP5zEstFz","type":"assistant","uuid":"2af73a0c-8c5f-47cc-aca4-26dabb5d171c","timestamp":"2026-10-19T16:55:20.945Z","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"3b59b3ab-40e2-4906-ae5b-518d2b1a7b53","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/trilliumsmith/fm_home/firstmate","sessionId":"3b59b3ab-40e2-4906-ae5b-518d2b1a7b53","version":"2.1.293","gitBranch":"main","slug":"floating-tinkering-lemur"}
