{"parentUuid":"254d3a44-ce13-4341-b922-81069f718673","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgBxDrp2CE3QgJPxeipSh","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Captain, you're right, and I've redirected the Fable scout. \"Mac-only, can't be ported\" was the wrong conclusion.\n\n1. **New brief:** the scout now treats the port to the iPhone as a given and has to plan how. The plan must cover the acoustic model, the decoder and the vocabulary biasing.\n2. **Starting points I gave it:**\n   - The acoustic model is a 111MB ONNX file, which can run on iOS through ONNX Runtime or a CoreML conversion.\n   - The decoder and vocabulary files use open formats. The decoder library is only the Mac build of them, so it can be rebuilt for the phone.\n   - The Whisper models can run on iOS with whisper.cpp.\n3. **Report:** it will rewrite `data/talon-phone-grammar-scout-q2/report.md` with a porting path, effort and risk per piece, and a first spike that gets the acoustic model emitting tokens on an iPhone. It will list the licence check as a risk item and not a blocker. A fallback is allowed only if a specific piece proves impossible, with evidence.\n4. **Logged:** I recorded your words in the scout's instructions and in status-kdv.\n\nI'll bring you the report when it lands. Brain PR #46 (https://github.com/trillium/brain/pull/46) is still being rebased."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1040,"cache_read_input_tokens":141127,"output_tokens":443,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1040,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":443,"cache_read_input_tokens":141127,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1040,"cache_creatio