{"parentUuid":"fc31f449-eb21-4d55-ae9a-3371a3abf6e9","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgByCRpx4EZ3n1Gorx5Mi","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Captain, I cleaned up forefront-backend and one robots item this poke, and I'm still waiting on the Fable Talon scout.\n\n- **Usage:** Claude has 43% left (Fable 38%) with the weekly window about 14 hours from reset, so I'm still underspending.\n- **Closed PRs #2 and #3:** forefront-backend PR #5 already covers their bearer-auth and token-leak work, so I closed them as superseded.\n- **Consolidation task:** PRs #4, #6 and #7 are three copies of the same \"make the repo green\" change, all blocked by the billing failures. I filed a task to merge them into one after billing is fixed. https://github.com/trillium/forefront-backend/pull/7\n- **Commitments change:** the injectable commitments runner is committed but has no PR yet. I told its worker to run the validation and report the PR. You decide that merge, since the commitments worker still needs to open the PR.\n- **robots-shos9:** closed. The stray database is quarantined and brain PR #47 fixed the cause.\n- **Talon scout:** still running.\n\nI logged the numbers in status-kdv. Still waiting on you:\n- Fix GitHub billing.\n- Barterboo PRs #2 and #7 (https://github.com/trillium/barter/pull/2) have red checks.\n- Land `fm/dotfiles-codex-q1`, then log in to codex."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":817,"cache_read_input_tokens":153204,"output_tokens":465,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":817,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":465,"cache_read_input_tokens":153204,"cache_creation_input