{"parentUuid":"9a5e282e-4fc2-4be3-abfd-a7ec17ca873f","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgBzTajmbovoaGLn1hEei","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Captain, forefront-backend PR 8 is merged and closed out: https://github.com/trillium/forefront-backend/pull/8\n\n1. **Merged.** The `runCommitments` change was green and is merged. It makes `runCommitments` injectable, so the `/commitments*` route tests can use a fake runner. Idea idea-pag9 (inject `runCommitments`) is closed, and the worker is cleaned up.\n2. **Fleet sync.** The forefront-backend clone couldn't update. It sits on `main` with uncommitted changes and is 2 commits behind `origin/fm/forefront-chat-endpoints`. I didn't touch it. I haven't filed a ticket for it yet.\n3. **Codex dotfiles change is ready but not landed.** The codex CLI addition for the macbook nix config is on branch `fm/dotfiles-codex-q1`. It builds, and I haven't run a switch. That project lands locally, so it needs your word before I land it. Codex login comes after that.\n4. **Talon phone scout is still running.** The scout is working on a path to run Talon's recognizer on the phone. Its report hasn't landed yet.\n5. **Still open on you:** fixing GitHub billing at github.com/settings/billing. The billing problem is what keeps barter PRs 2 and 7 and forefront-backend PR 7 red.\n\n**Note:** The notification ack printed a \"queued wakes pending\" warning that I haven't confirmed cleared. The branch-outcome mark-processed refused to advance past the read cursor (2116)."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":828,"cache_read_input_tokens":83616,"output_tokens":518,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":828,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens