{"parentUuid":"de74352d-2a0e-44e1-bd6c-ef5b264d9427","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgC1LZKcbgtEYf8NkbZSb","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Yes, partly. Apple Notes is connected and working. The tools are live in this session, so I can create, read, search, move and append to notes, and attach files to them.\n\nHow it works:\n1. **Notes in Apple Notes:** ask me to add a note, append to one, or find one. I call the Apple Notes tools directly (create-note, append-to-note, search-notes, and so on). It runs on the macbook and syncs through iCloud, so the note shows up on your phone.\n2. **Notes inside the fleet:** the bead stores are the durable place (`brain` for knowledge, `inbox` for quick captures, `status-kdv` for the running log). Drop something in `inbox` and I treat it as a message from you.\n\n**Open item:** one part of that request, inbox-cglf, is still waiting on you. It asked to deactivate the first set of MCP tools, and it needs you to name which tools. The Apple Notes part is done.\n\nWhat do you want to capture, and where should it live: Apple Notes or a bead?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":289,"cache_read_input_tokens":95698,"output_tokens":464,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":137},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":289,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":464,"cache_read_input_tokens":95698,"cache_creation_input_tokens":289,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":289},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgC1LZ6xFRFoxGbyD