better\n      base: copyleft ones (Ice Cubes AGPL, Mastodon GPL, Karakeep AGPL, Joplin    \n      AGPL, MoeMemos MPL) are out; wallabag has no LICENSE file and is abandoned; \n      MIT ones (readeck-ios, swift-paperless, bookmark-companion, NetNewsWire) are\n      full product clients costlier to strip than ~150 new lines. Lift MIT        \n      snippets with attribution: XcodeGen app-extension block from                \n      framara/SwiftDataSharing project.yml; URL/text loading from readeck-ios     \n      URLShare/ShareBookmarkViewModel.swift:78-120; image/PDF loading from swift- \n      paperless ShareExtension/AttachmentManager+receiveAttachment.swift; keychain\n      access-group secret pattern from readeck KeychainHelper.swift. Report:      \n      ~/fm_home/macbook-ops/data/firstmate-share-scout-20261019/report.md         \n  2026-10-19 05:11 Trillium Smith\n    \n      Scout done (data/firstmate-share-scout-20261019/report.md): stamp           \n      testflight-starter + own Share Extension, MIT snippets lifted from          \n      SwiftDataSharing/readeck-ios/swift-paperless. Stamped projects/firstmate-   \n      share (local-only, team 85PWBA3B59, com.trillium.firstmateshare). Build     \ncaptain-shared.md\ndisplayd-shared-control-surface","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"4f58bd00-417f-4d01-8a76-35ae36e175ef","timestamp":"2026-10-19T17:41:35.405Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"○ project-p16v · Firstmate Share: iOS share-sheet app that sends anything to firstmate with a poke   [● P2 · OPEN]\nOwner: Trillium Smith · Type: task\nCreated: 2026-10-19 · Updated: 2026-10-19\n\nDESCRIPTION\n  (none)\n\nLABELS: project:iphone-share\n\nMETADATA\n  brain_slug: firstmate-share-ios-share-sheet-app-that-sends-anything-to-firstmate-with-a-poke\n\nCOMMENTS\n  2026-10-19 04:54 Trillium Smith\n    \n      Captain 2026-10-18: wants an app he can share things to, exactly like the   \n      iPhone share sheet; picking the app sends the item (URL, text, image, file) \n      to firstmate with a poke. Plan: iOS Share Extension + tiny host app (stamp  \n      from macbook-ops/projects/testflight-starter, SwiftUI, XcodeGen). Receiver: \n      small tailnet-only HTTPS endpoint on the MacBook (like talon feed :7399)    \n      that files an inbox-store bead (inbox q) with the shared content; inbox-    \n      store-watch already wakes firstmate on new inbox beads = the poke. Install  \n      via OTA (make ota pattern from task-pyc1w / TinyKeyboard ota-publish.sh)    \n      once Xcode has the Apple ID. Auth: tailnet-only + shared secret header.     \n      Acceptance: share a Safari URL from the phone, an inbox bead appears within \n      seconds, firstmate wakes.                                                   \n  2026-10-19 04:55 Trillium Smith\n    \n      Captain asked for a deeper starter search before building; scout dispatched \n      to macbook-ops. Build waits on the recommendation.                          \n  2026-10-19 05:01 Trillium Smith\n    \n      Scout done (task-p9k59): recommend stamping projects/testflight-starter     \n      (XcodeGen) and adding our own Share Extension target. No OSS app is a better\n      base: copyleft ones (Ice Cubes AGPL, Mastodon GPL, Karakeep AGPL, Joplin    \n      AGPL, MoeMemos MPL) are out; wallabag has no LICENSE file and is abandoned; \n      MIT ones (readeck-ios, swift-paperless, bookmark-companion, NetNewsWire) are\n      full product clients costlier to strip than ~150 new lines. Lift MIT        \n      snippets with attribution: XcodeGen app-extension block from                \n      framara/SwiftDataSharing project.yml; URL/text loading from readeck-ios     \n      URLShare/ShareBookmarkViewModel.swift:78-120; image/PDF loading from swift- \n      paperless ShareExtension/AttachmentManager+receiveAttachment.swift; keychain\n      access-group secret pattern from readeck KeychainHelper.swift. Report:      \n      ~/fm_home/macbook-ops/data/firstmate-share-scout-20261019/report.md       