{"parentUuid":"344d61d0-2154-40a8-ba76-ba0c26437291","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"total_tokens_reminder","text":"<total_tokens>14992355 tokens left</total_tokens>"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"284b3be3-13ef-400f-8474-57c6392671d4","timestamp":"2026-10-19T17:42:21.538Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\n<total_tokens>14992355 tokens left</total_tokens>\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","session_id":"3b59b3ab-40e2-4906-ae5b-518d2b1a7b53","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/trilliumsmith/fm_home/firstmate","sessionId":"3b59b3ab-40e2-4906-ae5b-518d2b1a7b53","version":"2.1.293","gitBranch":"main","slug":"floating-tinkering-lemur"}
{"parentUuid":"284b3be3-13ef-400f-8474-57c6392671d4","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgC1THW3yFqWxggE8Lh4x","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Captain, today you can't add text to a share. The app sends only the item itself (URL, text, image or file) and doesn't ask for any instruction. So an Instagram screenshot reaches me with no ask, and I have to come back and ask you what it's for.\n\nHow it works now:\n1. **Share goes in:** you pick Firstmate Share in the share sheet. The item goes to a private endpoint on the MacBook, reachable only over your tailnet.\n2. **Bead and wake:** the endpoint files an inbox bead and wakes me.\n3. **Tested only with simulated shares:** a URL, a PNG and some text all arrived. Nothing has been shared from your phone yet.\n\nHow the text will work, once built:\n- **Note field:** an optional box in the share sheet, so you can type something like \"add them to the person store, we want to contact them for barter\".\n- **Quick chips:** one-tap options such as person store, save for later and task.\n- **Where it goes:** both are written into the inbox bead body next to the image, so I see the ask with the item.\n- **Follow-up note:** you can also add a note to a share you already sent.\n\nNone of this is built yet. I filed it as task-hx0p9 (note field, chips and follow-up note) under the Firstmate Share project, project-p16v.\n\nTwo things stop you from using the app at all:\n- The built app is on branch `fm/firstmate-share-build-20261019` and waits for your word to land it.\n- Installing it on your phone is blocked because Xcode has no Apple ID for the signing team. That is review-2k73.\n\nWant me to dispatch the note-field build now?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":446,"cache_read_input_tokens":103689,"output_tokens":520,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_