{"parentUuid":"c47ff17a-9722-40d4-9701-499a06f1b9f2","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgC2YuevQDAzSgVmJEiNV","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Captain, the Talon scout says your phone can run Talon's recognizer. Nothing has run on a real iPhone yet, so that part is still unproven.\n\nWhat it showed on the Mac, using your own model files:\n- **Acoustic model:** runs on Apple's CoreML at about 10 ms per utterance and gives the correct transcript.\n- **Decoder:** builds unmodified for iPhone, and reproduces Talon's transcript from Talon's own word list.\n- **Command grammar:** a hand-built grammar decoded commands in 0.1 to 0.4 ms.\n\nThe scout also says my earlier \"Mac-only\" conclusion was wrong. Only Talon's built-in copy of the decoder and one Python step in the model are Mac-only, and both have open replacements.\n\nEstimated total is 13 to 20 days. The pieces, in order:\n1. A bare iPhone app that prints the transcript of Talon's test recording on a physical phone. That takes 2 to 3 days.\n2. The decoder plus the command grammar.\n3. The grammar compiler, which is the largest piece.\n\nTalon stays the authority on the Mac. The phone sends recognized phrases to the existing `/execute` endpoint.\n\nI filed step 1 as task-gj3l7 and sent it to the iPhone/Xcode worker in the macbook-ops home. The send printed no confirmation, so I don't know if it landed, and I may have sent it twice. I'll check that worker's status. Your recordings folder stays untouched.\n\n**One risk to check:** the Talon licence wording on using its models outside Talon is unknown. The scout recommends reading it and emailing Talon support, and says to keep this to personal use."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":458,"cache_read_input_tokens":121309,"output_tokens":557,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":458,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":557,"cache_read_input_tokens":121309,"cache_creation_input_tokens":458,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":458},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgC2YuJayxjRjqdKpoWWv","type":"assistant","uuid":"b26ed8bf-1161-4e7c-b3d6-ebf2055068e8","timestamp":"2026-10-19T17:56:49.282Z","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"3b59b3ab-40e2-4906-ae5b-518d2b1a7b53","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/trilliumsmith/fm_home/firstmate","sessionId":"3b59b3ab-40e2-4906-ae5b-518d2b1a7b53","version":"2.1.293","gitBranch":"main","slug":"floating-tinkering-lemur"}
