ot folded into the plan (task-uzrc2, P1)</li>\n<li>Webhook HTTPS strategy undecided (task-axw1)</li>\n<li>No git remote; local only</li></ul>\n<h2>Owner</h2><ul><li>mini0-ops took over the build on 2026-10-11. It is logged out, so nothing is moving there.</li>\n<li>Waiting on you: remaining setup choices (hold calendar-takeover-decisions) and the soak credentials</li></ul>","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"9de841f1-0099-4254-8ed0-9c3cf8b3c102","timestamp":"2026-10-19T17:57:36.253Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"6:<a class=\"p\" href=\"dental-proposal.pdf\"><b>Dental exchange proposal (Dr. Homyak)</b><span>Staff-appreciation massage for dental services. Placeholders on the dental side.</span></a>\n7:<a class=\"p\" href=\"massage-flyer-v4.pdf\"><b>Massage flyer v4 (final copy)</b><span>Let The Spa Come To You, GATHER50 expires 10/28. Preview: massage-flyer-v4.png</span></a>\n8:<a class=\"p\" href=\"massage-flyer-v3.pdf\"><b>Massage flyer v3 (GATHER50)</b><span>Own copy, native-aspect photos. Check the $600 vs $300 cap. Preview: massage-flyer-v3.png</span></a>\n<!doctype html><meta charset=utf-8><meta name=viewport content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>Calendar status</title>\n<style>body{font:clamp(16px,1.6vw,30px)/1.5 system-ui;margin:0;padding:4vh 5vw;background:#111;color:#eee;max-width:70ch}\nh1{margin:0 0 .2em}h2{margin:1.2em 0 .3em;font-size:1.1em;color:#9cf}.ok{color:#7d7}.no{color:#f96}li{margin:.25em 0}small{opacity:.6}</style>\n<h1>Dolt-backed calendar</h1><small>brain-calendar-service · as of 2026-10-17</small>\n<h2>Built <span class=ok>✓</span></h2><ul>\n<li>MCP calendar service in ~/dev/brain-calendar-service; Beads/Dolt is the planning source of truth</li>\n<li>All build stages through S10 (migration + rollout) done and verified on main</li>\n<li>Runnable smoke-test path done (task-b1gb8)</li>\n<li>Six real-use limitations fixed: DB-backed store, list_changes, sync apply step, OAuth token plumbing</li>\n<li>Latest commit: \"db-backed mcp store, t