{"parentUuid":"4fb99f17-206a-4edb-b16b-9fe686e3e415","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgC2ciiyCVNmrjHcvTBJc","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1160,"cache_read_input_tokens":124315,"output_tokens":2585,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":166},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1160,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2585,"cache_read_input_tokens":124315,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1160,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1160},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":1949,"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgC2ciKQDBcq9H31F7JdZ","type":"assistant","uuid":"a0ab7734-7ca0-4ff3-bdb6-b8f7a93c9582","timestamp":"2026-10-19T17:57:39.506Z","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"3b59b3ab-40e2-4906-ae5b-518d2b1a7b53","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/trilliumsmith/fm_home/firstmate","sessionId":"3b59b3ab-40e2-4906-ae5b-518d2b1a7b53","version":"2.1.293","gitBranch":"main","slug":"floating-tinkering-lemur"}
{"parentUuid":"a0ab7734-7ca0-4ff3-bdb6-b8f7a93c9582","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgC2ciiyCVNmrjHcvTBJc","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01WbEjyhycUmUi6duyziEUth","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"S=/Users/trilliumsmith/fm_home/firstmate/.lavish/site; cat > $S/firstmate-share-mockups.html <<'EOF'\n<!doctype html><meta charset=utf-8><meta name=viewport content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>Firstmate Share mockups</title>\n<style>\n:root{--bg:#111;--fg:#eee;--mut:#9aa;--card:#1c1c1e;--acc:#4da3ff;--ok:#7d7}\nbody{font:16px/1.5 system-ui;margin:0;padding:16px;background:var(--bg);color:var(--fg);max-width:1100px;margin-inline:auto}\nh1{margin:.2em 0}h2{color:#9cf;margin:1.6em 0 .3em}small,.mut{color:var(--mut)}\n.row{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:20px;align-items:flex-start}\n.phone{width:290px;background:var(--card);border-radius:28px;padding:16px;border:1px solid #333;box-sizing:border-box}\n.phone h3{margin:.1em 0 .5em;font-size:15px;text-align:center}\n.thumb{height:90px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#c13584,#fd8d32);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:13px;margin-bottom:10px}\n.chips{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin:8px 0}\n.chip{padding:8px 12px;border-radius:999px;border:1px solid #444;font-size:14px}\n.chip.on{background:var(--acc);border-color:var(--acc);color:#001}\n.note{border:1px solid #444;border-radius:10px;padding:10px;min-height:48px;color:var(--mut);font-size:14px}\n.send{margin-top:12px;background:var(--acc);color:#001;text-align:center;padding:12px;border-radius:12px;font-weight:600}\n.cap{font-size:13px;color:var(--mut);margin-top:8px}\n.flow{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;align-items:center}\n.step{background:var(--card);border:1px solid #333;border-radius:10px;padding:8px 12px;font-size:14px}\n.arrow{color:var(--mut)}\n.q{background:var(--card);border-left:4px solid var(--acc);padding:10px 14px;border-radius:8px;margin:8px 0}\n.q.b{border-color:#fc6}\n</style>\n<h1>Firstmate Share: compose step</h1>\n<small>Mockups only, nothing built. For your pick. 2026-10-19</small>\n\n<h2>What you said</h2>\n<div class=q>Chips allow several at once, which is wrong. \"Later\" is unclear. Show the flow you want in mockups.</div>\n<p><b>What \"Later\" meant today:</b> a bookmark. Save it, no action now, I'd file it as reading-list/reference. It's a vague name, so the options below replace it.</p>\n\n<h2>The flow</h2>\n<div class=flow>\n<span class=step>1 Share from any app</span><span class=arrow>→</span>\n<span class=step>2 Pick Firstmate</span><span class=arrow>→</span>\n<span class=step>3 Choose ONE thing to do</span><span class=arrow>→</span>\n<span class=step>4 Optional note</span><span class=arrow>→</span>\n<span class=step>5 Send</span><span class=arrow>→</span>\n<span class=step>6 Bead filed, firstmate acts</span>\n</div>\n<p class=mut>After sending, the app can add a follow-up note to the same share.</p>\n\n<h2>Option A: one choice, plain verbs (single-select)</h2>\n<div class=row>\n<div class=phone><h3>Firstmate</h3><div class=thumb>Instagram screenshot</div>\n<div class=cap>What should I do with this?</div>\n<div class=chips><span class=\"chip on\">Add a person</span><span class=chip>Make a task</span><span class=chip>Save an idea</span><span class=chip>Just keep it</span></div>\n<div class=note>we want to contact them for barter</div><div class=send>Send</div>\n<div class=cap>Tap one; tapping another switches. \"Just keep it\" is the default.</div></div>\n<div><b>Good:</b> one decision, clear verbs, no ambiguity for me.<br><b>Cost:</b> can't say \"task AND person\" in one share; use the note.</div>\n</div>\n\n<h2>Option B: no chips, note only, I decide</h2>\n<div class=row>\n<div class=phone><h3>Firstmate</h3><div class=thumb>Instagram screenshot</div>\n<div class=cap>Tell me what to do (optional)</div>\n<div class=note>add them to the person store, contact for barter</div><div class=send>Send</div>\n<div class=cap>Simplest screen. I read the note and route it.</div></div>\n<div><b>Good:</b> most flexible, handles combos.<br><b>Cost:</b> more typing on the phone; voice dictation helps.</div>\n</div>\n\n<h2>Option C: chips as quick-fill for the note</h2>\n<div class=row>\n<div class=phone><h3>Firstmate</h3><div class=thumb>Instagram screenshot</div>\n<div class=chips><span class=chip>Add person</span><span class=chip>Task</span><span class=chip>Idea</span></div>\n<div class=note>Add person: <i>we want to contact them for barter</i></div><div class=send>Send</div>\n<div class=cap>Tapping a chip types its phrase into the note. You can edit or stack phrases. Everything sent is just text.</div></div>\n<div><b>Good:</b> fast taps plus free text, combos possible.<br><b>Cost:</b> chips aren't a strict choice, so it is less structured.</div>\n</div>\n\n<h2>Your call</h2>\n<div class=q><b>1.</b> A, B or C?</div>\n<div class=\"q b\"><b>2.</b> If A: which four choices? My guess: Add a person, Make a task, Save an idea, Just keep it.</div>\n<div class=\"q b\"><b>3.</b> Anything missing, e.g. \"Reply to this\", \"Add to calendar\", \"Research this\"?</div>\n<p class=mut>Bigger idea you mentioned: shares as an agent tool. Agents could also share to you or each other through the same endpoint. Say the word and I'll mock that flow too.</p>\nEOF\nsed -i '6i <a class=\"p\" href=\"firstmate-share-mockups.html\"><b>Firstmate Share mockups (compose step)</b><span>Three options for single-select intent, no \"Later\". Pick A, B or C.</span></a>' $S/index.html; curl -s -o /dev/null -w '%{http_code}\\n' http://macbook:4380/firstmate-share-mockups.html"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1160,"cache_read_input_tokens":124315,"output_tokens":2585,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":166},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1160,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2585,"cache_read_input_tokens":124315,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1160,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1160},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01WbEjyhycUmUi6duyziEUth":{"command":"S=/Users/trilliumsmith/fm_home/firstmate/.lavish/site; cat > $S/firstmate-share-mockups.html <<'EOF'\n<!doctype html><meta charset=utf-8><meta name=viewport content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>Firstmate Share mockups</title>\n<style>\n:root{--bg:#111;--fg:#eee;--mut:#9aa;--card:#1c1c1e;--acc:#4da3ff;--ok:#7d7}\nbody{font:16px/1.5 system-ui;margin:0;padding:16px;background:var(--bg);color:var(--fg);max-width:1100px;margin-inline:auto}\nh1{margin:.2em 0}h2{color:#9cf;margin:1.6em 0 .3em}small,.mut{color:var(--mut)}\n.row{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:20px;align-items:flex-start}\n.phone{width:290px;background:var(--card);border-radius:28px;padding:16px;border:1px solid #333;box-sizing:border-box}\n.phone h3{margin:.1em 0 .5em;font-size:15px;text-align:center}\n.thumb{height:90px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#c13584,#fd8d32);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:13px;margin-bottom:10px}\n.chips{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin:8px 0}\n.chip{padding:8px 12px;border-radius:999px;border:1px solid #444;font-size:14px}\n.chip.on{background:var(--acc);border-color:var(--acc);color:#001}\n.note{border:1px solid #444;border-radius:10px;padding:10px;min-height:48px;color:var(--mut);font-size:14px}\n.send{margin-top:12px;background:var(--acc);color:#001;text-align:center;padding:12px;border-radius:12px;font-weight:600}\n.cap{font-size:13px;color:var(--mut);margin-top:8px}\n.flow{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;align-items:center}\n.step{background:var(--card);border:1px solid #333;border-radius:10px;padding:8px 12px;font-size:14px}\n.arrow{color:var(--mut)}\n.q{background:var(--card);border-left:4px solid var(--acc);padding:10px 14px;border-radius:8px;margin:8px 0}\n.q.b{border-color:#fc6}\n</style>\n<h1>Firstmate Share: compose step</h1>\n<small>Mockups only, nothing built. For your pick. 2026-10-19</small>\n\n<h2>What you said</h2>\n<div class=q>Chips allow several at once, which is wrong. \"Later\" is unclear. Show the flow you want in mockups.</div>\n<p><b>What \"Later\" meant today:</b> a bookmark. Save it, no action now, I'd file it as reading-list/reference. It's a vague name, so the options below replace it.</p>\n\n<h2>The flow</h2>\n<div class=flow>\n<span class=step>1 Share from any app</span><span class=arrow>→</span>\n<span class=step>2 Pick Firstmate</span><span class=arrow>→</span>\n<span class=step>3 Choose ONE thing to do</span><span class=arrow>→</span>\n<span class=step>4 Optional note</span><span class=arrow>→</span>\n<span class=step>5 Send</span><span class=arrow>→</span>\n<span class=step>6 Bead filed, firstmate acts</span>\n</div>\n<p class=mut>After sending, the app can add a follow-up note to the same share.</p>\n\n<h2>Option A: one choice, plain verbs (single-select)</h2>\n<div class=row>\n<div class=phone><h3>Firstmate</h3><div class=thumb>Instagram screenshot</div>\n<div class=cap>What should I do with this?</div>\n<div class=chips><span class=\"chip on\">Add a person</span><span class=chip>Make a task</span><span class=chip>Save an idea</span><span class=chip>Just keep it</span></div>\n<div class=note>we want to contact them for barter</div><div class=send>Send</div>\n<div class=cap>Tap one; tapping another switches. \"Just keep it\" is the default.</div></div>\n<div><b>Good:</b> one decision, clear verbs, no ambiguity for me.<br><b>Cost:</b> can't say \"task AND person\" in one share; use the note.</div>\n</div>\n\n<h2>Option B: no chips, note only, I decide</h2>\n<div class=row>\n<div class=phone><h3>Firstmate</h3><div class=thumb>Instagram screenshot</div>\n<div class=cap>Tell me what to do (optional)</div>\n<div class=note>add them to the person store, contact for barter</div><div class=send>Send</div>\n<div class=cap>Simplest screen. I read the note and route it.</div></div>\n<div><b>Good:</b> most flexible, handles combos.<br><b>Cost:</b> more typing on the phone; voice dictation helps.</div>\n</div>\n\n<h2>Option C: chips as quick-fill for the note</h2>\n<div class=row>\n<div class=phone><h3>Firstmate</h3><div class=thumb>Instagram screenshot</div>\n<div class=chips><span class=chip>Add person</span><span class=chip>Task</span><span class=chip>Idea</span></div>\n<div class=note>Add person: <i>we want to contact them for barter</i></div><div class=send>Send</div>\n<div class=cap>Tapping a chip types its phrase into the note. You can edit or stack phrases. Everything sent is just text.</div></div>\n<div><b>Good:</b> fast taps plus free text, combos possible.<br><b>Cost:</b> chips aren't a strict choice, so it is less structured.</div>\n</div>\n\n<h2>Your call</h2>\n<div class=q><b>1.</b> A, B or C?</div>\n<div class=\"q b\"><b>2.</b> If A: which four choices? My guess: Add a person, Make a task, Save an idea, Just keep it.</div>\n<div class=\"q b\"><b>3.</b> Anything missing, e.g. \"Reply to this\", \"Add to calendar\", \"Research this\"?</div>\n<p class=mut>Bigger idea you mentioned: shares as an agent tool. Agents could also share to you or each other through the same endpoint. Say the word and I'll mock that flow too.</p>\nEOF\nsed -i '6i <a class=\"p\" href=\"firstmate-share-mockups.html\"><b>Firstmate Share mockups (compose step)</b><span>Three options for single-select intent, no \"Later\". Pick A, B or C.</span></a>' $S/index.html; curl -s -o /dev/null -w '%{http_code}\\n' http://macbook:4380/firstmate-share-mockups.html"}},"apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgC2ciKQDBcq9H31F7JdZ","type":"assistant","uuid":"af438b79-c40a-40d3-b7b8-9624da7a7bf1","timestamp":"2026-10-19T17:57:54.917Z","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"3b59b3ab-40e2-4906-ae5b-518d2b1a7b53","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/trilliumsmith/fm_home/firstmate","sessionId":"3b59b3ab-40e2-4906-ae5b-518d2b1a7b53","version":"2.1.293","gitBranch":"main","slug":"floating-tinkering-lemur"}
