{"parentUuid":"0b6feea0-64a0-4027-aeb1-d771fbada949","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgC2f1By39XnCMtf5C5Ht","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Yes, captain. The Fable Talon scout finished, and its report is at `data/talon-phone-grammar-scout-q2/report.md`. Its worker has already been cleaned up.\n\nThe report found the Talon recognizer can run on the iPhone. On the Mac, with your own model files, the acoustic model ran at about 10 ms per utterance and the decoder built for iPhone. The scout wrote no code, so nothing needs landing.\n\nThe next step is the first iPhone spike, filed as task-gj3l7 and sent to the macbook-ops worker. That worker is idle (parked), so I haven't confirmed it picked the spike up.\n\nThe share-app mockup page is also up, at http://macbook:4380/firstmate-share-mockups.html. It shows three compose-screen options: A is one choice with plain verbs, B is a note only, and C is chips that fill in the note. No option has \"Later\". Which one do you want?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":444,"cache_read_input_tokens":128887,"output_tokens":348,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":46},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":444,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":348,"cache_read_input_tokens":128887,"cache_creation_input_tokens":444,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":444},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgC2ezwLVGxC3pykLJKCg","type":"assistant","uuid":"52c60a99-4652-4794-b640-3016fbecb92a","timestamp":"2026-10-19T17:58:10.7