{"parentUuid":"0b922a02-fff1-47da-8f8b-e3a3b6e8e661","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgC4Ldz13NRX5bcc7Qxdb","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Captain, Talon's recognizer now runs on your iPhone 17 Pro Max. It gave the same transcript as the Mac, at 9.1 ms per utterance against the Mac's 10 ms, using CoreML.\n\n- **Spike 1 passed:** a bare app on your phone ran the acoustic model on Talon's test recording and matched the Mac exactly.\n- **Needs your word to land:** it sits on local-only branch `fm/talon-phone-asr-spike1-20261019` (commit 539a10d). It stays there until you say so.\n- **Spike 2 started:** I filed task-6qvs7 and sent it to the macbook-ops worker. It adds the decoder to the app and loads Talon's word list. It then decodes the same recording on the phone, and tries a hand-built command grammar.\n- **Brain-capture fix:** the worker found the cause. The hook's finished-line pattern rejects the timestamped format, and the live rules file lacks the scout-report capture rule. It's still fixing that.\n\nThe worker was told to touch only the model files and never your recordings. I haven't confirmed the send went through, since `fm-send` printed no confirmation."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1084,"cache_read_input_tokens":150426,"output_tokens":386,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1084,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":386,"cache_read_input_tokens":150426,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1084,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1084},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"d