{"parentUuid":"24abb312-1f2b-4483-81c1-732aa6330daf","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgC5Sa4tK9iUXwA3D488J","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Captain, the fix for finished scouts not reaching brain is merged and live. PR: https://github.com/trillium/firstmate_hooks/pull/8\n\n- **Merged:** the hook now accepts any timestamped finished line and also captures a scout's report when its task is marked done. Its checks were green (GitGuardian was the only one reporting).\n- **Why a restart:** the hook worker had been running the old code since Oct 14, so the fix wouldn't have taken effect on its own. I restarted the worker and its bead poller, and both are running again.\n- **Not yet confirmed:** I haven't watched a new scout get filed into brain since the restart. The next scout to finish will be the real test.\n- **Closed:** robots-fkb70.\n\nStill waiting on you:\n1. Pick option A, B or C for the share app compose screen: http://macbook:4380/firstmate-share-mockups.html\n2. Say \"land it\" for the Talon spike, dotfiles and share app branches.\n3. Fix GitHub billing."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":334,"cache_read_input_tokens":160721,"output_tokens":335,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":334,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":335,"cache_read_input_tokens":160721,"cache_creation_input_tokens":334,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":334},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgC5SZn2UbvK8EdV4JSAQ","type