{"type":"pr-link","sessionId":"3b59b3ab-40e2-4906-ae5b-518d2b1a7b53","prNumber":2,"prUrl":"https://github.com/trillium/forefront-backend/pull/2","prRepository":"trillium/forefront-backend","timestamp":"2026-10-19T18:47:15.205Z"}
{"parentUuid":"05ade7aa-a301-4549-9215-ff988854cec0","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgC6QHoeJaGBQHr5A7cEA","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Yes, captain. I verified it a moment ago.\n\n**What runs:** two background services start at login through macOS launchd:\n- `com.fm-hooks.worker`\n- `com.fm-hooks.bead-poller`\n\nBoth show as alive. The worker's status report showed about 357,000 cycles run and 3,514 jobs processed since Oct 14, when it was last started. I restarted both today so they'd pick up the fix.\n\n**How it works:**\n1. **Hooks only observe.** When I run a command, the harness hook records the event into a queue folder under `~/.fm-hooks/queue` and returns right away. It never runs follow-on work, so it can't slow or break the tool.\n2. **The worker drains the queue.** It wakes every second, matches events against the rules file, and runs the matching actions. Those include filing beads, such as the scout-report capture.\n3. **The poller watches the stores.** It looks at the bead stores and the status files for changes, and feeds those events into the same queue.\n\n**What that means in practice:**\n- **Nothing fires without the worker.** If it dies, events pile up and no actions run. The status command reports \"not live\" in that case.\n- **Code changes need a restart.** The worker keeps running the old code until restarted, which is why the scout-capture fix needed one.\n- **Failures:** of the 3,514 jobs, 239 failed. I haven't looked into why.\n\nWant me to look at those 239 failures?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":412,"cache_read_input_tokens":163029,"output_tokens":467,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":412,"ephemer