{"parentUuid":"aea1b293-2f19-4ce3-85b6-83cd74e42eba","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgC7uCAkA8qtpo9FnW9b4","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Mockup updated with your changes: http://macbook:4380/firstmate-share-mockups.html. I also recorded them on `task-iydgi`.\n\n- **Box 1 (the thing plus your notes):** single-select chips for person, brain and task, plus a fourth \"More stores\" chip that opens an A-to-Z list of every store.\n- **Settings:** the three quick chips are configurable in the app. The defaults are person, brain and task.\n- **Box 2 (instructions):** a fixed \"inbox\" chip shows that these instructions go to the inbox bead.\n\nCaptain, one question. Should the store you pick in box 1 be a hint that firstmate follows when it processes the share, or should the app file the item straight into that store? I lean toward a hint. The inbox bead stays the routing step, and a wrong tap is cheap to fix.\n\nI still need your word to land `fm/firstmate-share-build-20261019` before I build this."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1198,"cache_read_input_tokens":96060,"output_tokens":304,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1198,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":304,"cache_read_input_tokens":96060,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1198,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1198},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgC7uBvrPJQcjGMqfn4nY","type":"assistant","uuid":"60be2fcc-aa37-4fb0-a3e7-bcc7c376cdcc","time