{"parentUuid":"e938670c-f359-4bb1-b0e2-9db13e8ff4fe","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgCA8LxgCxh2QewaqBMSg","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The Talon phone scout finished, captain, and the route works on paper. Two things need your call.\n\n**Route:** the phone sends the speech model's output, and the Mac swaps only Talon's model call. The second mate proved that swap at about 6 ms on a private test engine that never touches live Talon. It filed 6 work items and started 2 workers: a Mac receiver on that private engine, and packing of the phone's output for sending.\n\n**Your calls:**\n1. **Talon licence:** does Talon's licence (EULA) allow running its model on the phone? I tracked this as a task.\n2. **Network:** it wants one new tailscale serve mapping for the Mac receiver. Do you approve it?\n\n**Also ready:** the palette punctuation strip, as noted earlier, waits on your \"land it\"."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":279,"cache_read_input_tokens":131556,"output_tokens":259,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":279,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":259,"cache_read_input_tokens":131556,"cache_creation_input_tokens":279,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":279},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgCA8LiXtL9Jkq421hSEA","type":"assistant","uuid":"f905a4ba-7838-409c-897e-55b86bd7a3f5","timestamp":"2026-10-19T19:36:09.889Z","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"3b59b3ab-40e2-4906-ae