o co\n- inferences_subscriptions [local-only] - Inference subscription tracking; blank repo, no code yet (added 2026-09-18)\n- lnx-services [local-only] - Read-only service visualizer for the services running on lnx-server (systemd units, containers, listening port\n- displayd [direct-PR +yolo] - API-driven display server for the lnx-server jumbotron (renderers: text, image, solid, life, clock); source o\n- obs [direct-PR] - OBS Studio live-streaming setup: scene collections, Firebot overlays, multistream, control center, stream listener; orig\n- display [local-only] - Named Mac display-setup switcher (Go TUI over displayplacer presets); local repo, no remote; binary installs to ~/.\n- captains-deck [direct-PR +yolo] - Captain's Deck: Herdr kanban board plugin for Firstmate (Python TUI): read-only fleet board projected fr\n○ robots-d8dvl · subagent-pretool-check blocks ScheduleWakeup as delegation (matches 'schedul'); conflicts with time-wait-assertion-guard asking for a fallback timer   [● P2 · OPEN]\nOwner: Trillium Smith · Type: task\nCreated: 2026-10-19 · Updated: 2026-10-19\n\nDESCRIPTION\n  (none)\n\nMETADATA\n  brain_slug: subagent-pretool-check-blocks-schedulewakeup-as-delegation-matches-schedul-conflicts-with-time-wait-assertion-guard-asking-for-a-fallback-timer\n\nCOMMENTS\n  2026-10-19 06:33 Trillium Smith\n    \n      Repro 2026-10-19: time-wait-assertion-guard Stop hook says arm              \n      ScheduleWakeup; calling ScheduleWakeup then hits fm-subagent-pretool-       \n      check.sh deny ([subagent-dispatch], blocked tool ScheduleWakeup). The two   \n      guards contradict. Workaround: rely on fleet watcher (stale/status wakes) as\n      the fallback. Fix: exempt ScheduleWakeup in the subagent check, or let the  \n      time-wait guard accept the fleet watcher.                                   \n  2026-10-19 12:52 Trillium Smith\n    \n      2026-10-19 repro: time-wait-assertion-guard demanded ScheduleWakeup         \n      fallback; fm-subagent-pretool-check denied it ('delegation-shaped on        \n      schedul'). Hit on firstmate primary while supervising fb-green-q1. Fix      \n      direction: allowlist ScheduleWakeup in fm-subagent-pretool-check.sh         \n      (firstmate repo, self-repo gated).","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"a6793438-1575-4f94-8c17-0b53e8aa7d61","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"session_id":"3b59b3ab-40e2-4906-ae5b-518d2b1a7b53","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/trilliumsmith/fm_home/firstmate","sessionId":"3b59b3ab-40e2-4906-ae5b-518d2b1a7b53","version":"2.1.293","gitBranch":"main","slug":"floating-tinkering-lemur"}
