ist|preview|confirm)","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"6b2710ea-270d-415b-9444-4f0555119ae2","timestamp":"2026-10-19T21:24:55.382Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"  2026-10-18 05:51 Trillium Smith\n    \n      2026-10-17 poke: QR slice landed, errors fix-guide worker (task-u6ul8)      \n      running; open: phone scan, Chrome check task-7mfok. No new dispatch needed. \n  2026-10-18 06:52 Trillium Smith\n    \n      Poke: routed macbook-ops to redeploy live console with 8fb37a5 fix-guide    \n      errors (still old binary on :8791).                                         \n  2026-10-18 07:09 Trillium Smith\n    \n      Captain 2026-10-18 (verbatim): I really want to explore how to make sidecar \n      a fully functional control surface via talon too - iphone is a talon route  \n      controller, sidecar UI is hosted on macbook, iphone interacts with visuals  \n      from a sidecar pane anywhere out in the world (see task-7txy4)              \n  2026-10-18 20:06 Trillium Smith\n    \n      Captain 2026-10-18: Sidecar needs a way to force light/dark theme per       \n      pane/device. Fire TV is in light theme; captain prefers dark. Pages follow  \n      prefers-color-scheme, which the TV browser reports as light, so Sidecar     \n      needs an override (per-pane setting, driveable by agent via drive_pane/API).\n  2026-10-19 02:45 Trillium Smith\n    \n      Captain 2026-10-19 (verbatim): sidecar - shows qr code on non tailbet       \n      devices that has a qr code that has the token to the tailnet site so only   \n      tailnet devices authenticate. (Design: public Funnel :10000 page for an     \n      unauthenticated device shows a pairing QR; scanning it from a tailnet device\n      opens a tailnet-only approve URL, which authorizes that public session. Only\n      tailnet devices can mint access.)                                           \n  2026-10-19 03:09 Trillium Smith\n    \n      Captain 2026-10-19: no Funnel, vps01 as proxy -> task-k2354                 \n  20