{"parentUuid":"d83817f0-dc1f-4955-af37-d276b7936b71","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgCJSR4vFtNuqJScLVWMt","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Captain, **fm-hooks is working and mostly polished, and Sidecar pairing is live but I haven't seen proof of a real off-tailnet device pairing.**\n\n**fm-hooks**\n1. Working: hooks queue events and daemons apply them. Reliability fixes PR 4–12 are merged. The last three were the retry tests, the flaky-test timeout, and the temp-file cleanup (PRs 9, 10, 11), plus PR 12 for the cursor writers.\n2. Open: the 672 old failed jobs in the failed queue are still unreplayed. I never replayed them because the jobs are historical.\n3. Open: `project-73bi.5` (MIT LICENSE, tests, live view) is still not done.\n4. Open: of the three requirements in `project-lp7s` (\"hooks own all bead lifecycle\"), I haven't verified any as complete.\n5. The Sidecar menu integration (fm-hooks actions as a Sidecar interface) isn't started.\n\n**Sidecar pairing for off-tailnet machines**\n1. Done: a QR pairing slice is built and closed (`task-l9vv0`). An unauthenticated device shows a QR, and scanning it from a tailnet device approves that session.\n2. Done: you chose vps01 as the proxy instead of Funnel. The Funnel is off.\n3. Done: `https://sidecar.trilliumsmith.com` went live on 2026-10-19 through an A record to vps01 and a Caddy proxy to the Mac. I checked it through 1.1.1.1: the health check returns 200, `/v1/devices` returns 401, and `/pair` returns 404.\n4. Open: I have no record of a phone or other off-tailnet device scanning the QR and getting in.\n5. Open: some local resolvers still cache the old Vercel address for the domain.\n\nWant me to dispatch an end-to-end pairing check on the live domain from a device outside the tailnet?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":394,"cache_read_input_tokens":114995,"output_tokens":709,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":65},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":394,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":709,"cache_read_input_tokens":114995,"cache_creation_input_tokens":394,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":394},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgCJSQqH52TSTsxtq5JTF","type":"assistant","uuid":"b5df3d35-ae11-47e5-9494-8eaab9343d78","timestamp":"2026-10-19T21:25:12.921Z","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"3b59b3ab-40e2-4906-ae5b-518d2b1a7b53","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/trilliumsmith/fm_home/firstmate","sessionId":"3b59b3ab-40e2-4906-ae5b-518d2b1a7b53","version":"2.1.293","gitBranch":"main","slug":"floating-tinkering-lemur"}
