{"parentUuid":"a7f46c1f-cf8e-4487-8a3c-d1b6f3b9f0d8","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgCKhT8ii55yrsRrdXa2y","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Dispatched: `brain-sl1eq-q1`, a Fable ship in the brain project, to fix `robots-sl1eq` (bare `bd` in a fresh directory writing beads into a foreign store).\n\nI took the scout's recommended option B, since this is a reversible call: in client mode, `bd` will refuse create/update/close/delete/import when `BEADS_DIR` is unset and no `.beads` workspace is found. Read commands keep forwarding. Brain is no-mistakes with auto-merge, so it merges itself once checks pass. I'll close `robots-sl1eq` with the PR as evidence then.\n\nI recorded the decision on `robots-sl1eq` and logged the dispatch in `status-kdv`. The inbox note and wake are acked."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":446,"cache_read_input_tokens":126136,"output_tokens":256,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":446,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":256,"cache_read_input_tokens":126136,"cache_creation_input_tokens":446,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":446},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgCKhStqb6Hd4RQsLEv3Z","type":"assistant","uuid":"280c7953-6151-4b76-80d5-9bdda7b2bea2","timestamp":"2026-10-19T21:41:39.490Z","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"3b59b3ab-40e2-4906-ae5b-518d2b1a7b53","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/trilliumsmith/fm_home/firstmate","sessionI