{"parentUuid":"0062af27-9a13-41ca-aa37-6530cbf77be7","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgCL9KihWrYfkyTzMiXhS","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Captain, the plan is recorded, but I can't start sending work to MiniMax yet because the Mac has no MiniMax credential.\n\n`quota-axi` reports MiniMax as `auth_required`, with no `MINIMAX_API_KEY` and no pi credential. I also don't know what \"spacebunny\" is. It only appears in an old backup of the dispatch config, so I couldn't match it to a provider.\n\n**What I set up**\n1. **Routing:** Fable on Claude plans and handles the smart work. pi with MiniMax-M3.1-Flash builds the MIT OSS projects until 2026-10-22. `config/crew-harness` is already `pi`.\n2. **Tracking:** the plan and the blocker are recorded on `task-u245d`, and I saved a memory so later sessions follow it.\n\n**What I need from you**\n1. Give me the MiniMax API key or run the pi login, and tell me what \"spacebunny\" is (a provider, an account, or a pi setting).\n2. Once the credential works, I'll dispatch the MIT OSS ships (fm-hooks and the other MIT projects) on pi."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":437,"cache_read_input_tokens":133652,"output_tokens":372,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":437,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":372,"cache_read_input_tokens":133652,"cache_creation_input_tokens":437,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":437},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgCL9KTL99MCrht8phH