it as soon as the current work finishes (idle-turn design review: be deeply curious about what is being built, design-review as many projects as possible, file beads, log in status-kdv). (10) ROBOTS QUEUE (captain 2026-10-18): the robots queue is not being handled; each poke, take the top \n</pasted_content id=\"259f\">\n\nopen robots items (robots ready/list), diagnose or dispatch a fix, and close with evidence. (11) USAGE + SPEED METRICS (captain 2026-10-18): every poke, check usage metrics (run quota-axi; note window remaining vs time remaining) and our speed (tasks closed/PRs landed since last poke, agents idle vs busy, wakes handled). If usage is underspent for the time left, take on MORE work now: dispatch more ships/scouts, prefer Fable for planning and building, and do more review; do not waste the window. Log the numbers in status-kdv. (12) MORE WORK, MORE REVIEW (captain 2026-10-18): always keep the queue deep; review open PRs, scout reports, and fleet output every poke."}
