06)\nfix(turnend-guard): exempt read-only Pi sessions when another live session owns the lock (#205)\nfix(pending-reply): make the recovery repost report-only, never a re-issue (#204)\nfix(spawn): count only working workers against the away spend cap (#201)\nfeat(reap): add stale-worker reaper with record-only teardown (#203)\nfix(teardown): refuse open-PR ships and ignore the no-mistakes mirror (#202)\nfix(spawn): append the launch brief to raw launch commands (#199)\nfix(teardown): resolve lsof past PATH so leaked-process reaping survives a PATH without /usr/sbin (#197)\nfix: word the rejected-check wake as untrusted, not unauthenticated (#196)\nfix(fm-test-run): add scoped --stop and FM_TEST_ABORTED terminator (#195)\nfix: name the wake-queue lock holder's command and age when a drain is skipped (#193)\nfix(spawn): refuse a worktree held by a live sibling task (#192)\nfix: recover Herdr workers with structurally empty composers (#187)\nfeat(bin): log MCP session detail ahead of the gateway (#191)\nAdd an opt-in log of each Jev dispatch question and answer (#188)\nfix: surface unacknowledged captain inbox notes from a live watcher (#186)\nfeat(doctor): one-command layered stack health check (#189)\nfix(ci): pin the Pi package so a vendor release cannot redden required shards (#190)\nfix(spawn): read BASHPID under bash 3.2 instead of aborting\nfix(remote): configurable remote Herdr session defaulting to default, shared session host-owned (#185)\nfix(hooks): exit re-entered wrappers at once via FM_GIT_HOOK_ACTIVE sentinel (#184)\nTurn-time in-flight view plus notable-item bead convention (#181)\nFix bd-init hang: refuse wrapper self-exec when copied into repo hooks (#182)\nExempt trillium from no-mistakes gate alongside kunchenguid (#183)","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"17bea15d-47c0-4e5a-950c-ab6e8eaeff62","timestamp":"2026-10-19T22:53:01.410Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":" 231 files changed, 13285 insertions(+), 196 deletions(-)\n6095 34 bin\n4266 56 tests\n1704 120 ac