s to opencode v2 plugin API — restore Claude-Code-style agent steering\n○ task-ynrh5 ● P1 Build the resume resolver op the MCP consumer needs (resolve_resume) + manifest hygiene\n○ task-mwntv ● P1 firstmate: flag-monitoring or defect - fork-contribution briefs for the firstmate repo itself ship WITHOUT the anti-upstream PR rule\n○ task-9jp80 ● P1 herdr: make spawned agents land in the captain's own workspace (no stray per-task workspaces)\n○ task-aml2o ● P1 Captain holds cannot be created for adopted work: the beads path still uses the tasks-axi ownership check\n○ task-6bvt0 ● P1 herdr backend refuses every spawn: launcher pane returns an ambiguous tab/workspace identity\n○ task-1q6tl ● P1 Hand over the other home's three persistent secondmates to this home\n○ task-fkewo ● P1 Establish autonomous stewardship across projects and tasks\n○ task-75rn7 ● P1 Plan a store-backed Markdown bridge for Firstmate customizations\n○ task-ec1ej ● P1 PostHog Product Engineer — tailor résumé + cover letter to requirement #1 (agent-facing tooling)\n○ task-xec2i ● P1 PostHog Product Engineer — find a warm referral path before applying (0 contacts today)\n○ task-f9ov9 ● P1 Publish the AI-interview-system blog post (closes PostHog 'strong writing' gap)\n○ task-92h9p ● P1 EPIC: verify ChatGPT OAuth flow end to end on lnx\n○ task-dfex0 ● P1 Cut over lnx Coder to external Postgres (durable upgrades)\n○ task-2carp ● P1 OBS voice agent: status readback + name tokenization + unify scene paths\n○ task-ax69f ● P1 Voice stop-agent: server-side esc to pi pane, exactly once\n○ task-lfor1 ● P1 CI: explore file-hash/path-filter test skipping to stop full suites on trivial changes\n○ task-tokcp ● P1 [EPIC] Agentic loop maiden run: dashboard agent spins up dev-credentials box, first dev task\n○ task-pf5k7 ● P1 Restore mini2 bead access: one-clone Dolt migrate to v56 + missing firstmate contract scripts (fm-tasks-axi.sh)\n○ task-2aexn ● P1 Coder lnx: restart server container with Docker group access\n○