{"parentUuid":"b67941b6-a1a9-4fb9-8b18-14bba771fe7c","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgCT42dURK8a6r3k1P86E","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Nothing is running. Here is the list of what's ready and would justify Fable.\n\n**Fable-worthy (design, security, ambiguity, planning)**\n1. `task-03lms` — Barterboo security: the row-level security (RLS) policies let participants forge completed trades and reviews. The fix moves the state transitions into `SECURITY DEFINER` functions, which is delicate and wrong fixes are costly.\n2. `task-fkewo` — Establish autonomous stewardship across projects and tasks. This one is open-ended design.\n3. `task-vp1tv` — Scoping: telling firstmate which projects are active and making blocked ones visible.\n4. `task-75rn7` — Plan a store-backed Markdown bridge for Firstmate customizations. This directly attacks the fork-divergence problem (`task-kj3ni`).\n5. `task-59udi` — Port the PAI hooks to the opencode v2 plugin API. It's a cross-API port with steering semantics.\n6. `task-tokcp` — Epic: the agentic loop's maiden run, which spans dev credentials, a box and a first dev task.\n7. `task-gpnfa` — Parrot standalone app: Rust core, and the M0 parity spike needs judgment.\n8. `task-oxsbt` and its avenues (`.1` to `.6`) — Voice accessibility education: market strategy and pricing validation.\n9. `task-aml2o` and `task-6bvt0` — Firstmate defects in captain holds and in the Herdr backend spawn identity. Both need root-cause reasoning and are firstmate-repo work.\n10. `runbooks-86h` — The 24h dev-work audit. It was written for Fable.\n11. `project-p16v` — Firstmate Share target selection (your ask from earlier). It needs a design before any build.\n\n**Routine, no Fable needed (cheaper models or other machines)**\n- `task-ho60f` — Barterboo URL validation.\n- `task-ttugb` — forefront-backend CI.\n- `task-wh6t9` — a CI runner problem that is really a billing issue.\n- `task-ax69f` — Voice stop-agent: a server-side Esc sent exactly once.\n- `task-2carp` — OBS voice agent: status readback and scene paths.\n- `task-jz7q4`, `task-2aexn`, `task-dfex0` — Coder homelab ops.\n- `task-pf5k7` — Restore mini2 bead access.\n- `task-lfor1` — CI test skipping.\n\n**Not for any agent**\n- `task-lwpj6` — CYC prep.\n- `task-xec2i` — Warm referral outreach.\n- `task-f9ov9` — The blog post publish.\n\n**Note:** Fable is at about 14% until the reset at 23:50Z, so the real dispatch window opens then."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2601,"cache_read_input_tokens":157845,"output_tokens":1029,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":84},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2601,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1029,"cache_read_input_tokens":157845,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2601,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2601},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgCT42JNfyVi3MukiDUXZ","type":"assistant","uuid":"c4bde122-622b-4539-9994-2951fb6ffac7","timestamp":"2026-10-19T23:18:11.420Z","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"3b59b3ab-40e2-4906-ae5b-518d2b1a7b53","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/trilliumsmith/fm_home/firstmate","sessionId":"3b59b3ab-40e2-4906-ae5b-518d2b1a7b53","version":"2.1.293","gitBranch":"main","slug":"floating-tinkering-lemur"}
