{"type":"queue-operation","operation":"remove","timestamp":"2026-10-19T23:23:15.181Z","sessionId":"3b59b3ab-40e2-4906-ae5b-518d2b1a7b53","content":"<task-notification>\n<task-id>bqqv56g2s</task-id>\n<tool-use-id>toolu_013useiKF7Gsu8VrPxWy55vD</tool-use-id>\n<output-file>/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-trilliumsmith-fm-home-firstmate/3b59b3ab-40e2-4906-ae5b-518d2b1a7b53/tasks/bqqv56g2s.output</output-file>\n<status>completed</status>\n<summary>Background command \"export FM_HOME=/Users/trilliumsmith/fm_home/firstmate; B=$FM_HOME/bin; cat &gt; /private/tmp/claude-501/burst.py &lt;&lt;'E'\nimport sys,subprocess\nfm='/Users/trilliumsmith/fm_home/firstmate/'\ntid,proj,intent,spec=sys.argv[1:5]\nsubprocess.run([fm+'bin/fm-brief.sh',tid,proj,'--scout'],check=True,capture_output=True)\np=fm+f'data/{tid}/brief.md'\ns=open(p).read().replace('{TASK}',intent,1).replace('{FIRSTMATE_SPEC}',spec,1)\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nE\nmk(){ python3 -I /private/tmp/claude-501/burst.py \"$@\" &amp;&amp; $B/fm-tasks-axi.sh add \"$1\" \"$5\" --kind scout &gt;/dev/null 2&gt;&amp;1; HERDR_PANE_ID=wY7:p1 $B/fm-spawn.sh \"$1\" projects/$2 --scout --harness claude --model fable --effort xhigh 2&gt;&amp;1 | tail -1 | cut -c1-140; }\nS=\"Deliver a decision-ready report at data/&lt;id&gt;/report.md: findings, a recommended design, the smallest first slice, risks, and what needs the captain. Read-only: no edits to any project.\"\nmk fable-fmshare-q1 firstmate \"Firstmate Share (iOS share-sheet app, project-p16v) must be able to send a screenshot, and shares generally, to different firstmates (selectable target among the user's firstmate homes and secondmates) rather than one fixed endpoint.\" \"Design target selection: how the app learns the target list, how a chosen home receives it (inbox note per home vs existing poke path), auth, and the smallest buildable slice. $S\" \"Design Firstmate Share multi-firstmate targeting\"\nmk fable-mdbridge-q1 federated-markdown-bridge \"Plan a store-backed Markdown bridge for Firstmate customizations (task-75rn7) so local customizations stop diverging this fork from upstream firstmate.\" \"Read the project and the fork divergence summary in task-kj3ni; propose an architecture that moves our local customizations out of the tracked firstmate tree. $S\" \"Plan markdown bridge for firstmate customizations\"\nmk fable-scope-q1 firstmate \"Scoping (task-vp1tv): telling firstmate which projects are active, what needs work, and making world-blocks visible.\" \"Propose the data model, commands and session-start display. $S\" \"Scope active-project and world-block visibility\"\nmk fable-steward-q1 firstmate \"Establish autonomous stewardship across projects and tasks (task-fkewo).\" \"Define what autonomous stewardship means here, guardrails given the hard rules in AGENTS.md, and a first slice. $S\" \"Design autonomous stewardship\"\" completed (exit code 0)</summary>\n</task-notification>","reason":"absorbed_mid_turn","commandUuid":"e22e3b27-e802-474a-9c1b-5106bc7aa858","deliveryId":"8e6734b0-c191-428b-b9b6-0bbb3d3bb448"}
