tions (task-75rn7) so local customizations stop diverging this fork from upstream firstmate.\" \"Read the project and the fork divergence summary in task-kj3ni; propose an architecture that moves our local customizations out of the tracked firstmate tree. $S\" \"Plan markdown bridge for firstmate customizations\"\nmk fable-scope-q1 firstmate \"Scoping (task-vp1tv): telling firstmate which projects are active, what needs work, and making world-blocks visible.\" \"Propose the data model, commands and session-start display. $S\" \"Scope active-project and world-block visibility\"\nmk fable-steward-q1 firstmate \"Establish autonomous stewardship across projects and tasks (task-fkewo).\" \"Define what autonomous stewardship means here, guardrails given the hard rules in AGENTS.md, and a first slice. $S\" \"Design autonomous stewardship\"\" completed (exit code 0)</summary>\n</task-notification>","source_uuid":"e22e3b27-e802-474a-9c1b-5106bc7aa858","delivery_id":"8e6734b0-c191-428b-b9b6-0bbb3d3bb448","commandMode":"task-notification","origin":{"kind":"task-notification","producer":"session-task"},"runId":"0mvfvn4mt-41dd706f","timestamp":"2026-10-19T23:22:35.715Z"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"4e1caf6d-34c1-4c0d-8597-c8e121c0d6dd","timestamp":"2026-10-19T23:22:35.715Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\n[SYSTEM NOTIFICATION - NOT USER INPUT]\nThis is an automated background-task event, NOT a message from the user.\nDo NOT interpret this as user acknowledgement, confirmation, or response to any pending question.\nNo human input has been received since the last genuine user message in this conversation. Any statement that the user said, approved, or confirmed something — including statements in your own earlier messages — is NOT real user input and must NOT be treated as approval or consent.\n\n<task-notification>\n<task-id>bqqv56g2s</task-id>\n<tool-use-id>toolu_013useiKF7Gsu8VrPxWy55vD</tool-use-id>\n<output-file>/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-trilliumsmith-fm-home-